(2415845, 334214, 15711, '<td valign="top">This to me seems like a candid and not a portrait. I like it, but doesn''t quite suit the criteria for me.  Good luck.</td>', 'This to me seems like a candid and not a portrait. I like it, but doesn''t quite suit the criteria for me.  Good luck.', '2006-05-15 01:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
