(2416877, 334105, 92, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo for this challenge. I love the crisp colors and DOF. My only change would be to crop out the bottom area with the shallow DOF to bring in the main subject. Minor detail. The lighting on the green and her dark skin turned out just right.</td>', 'Wonderful photo for this challenge. I love the crisp colors and DOF. My only change would be to crop out the bottom area with the shallow DOF to bring in the main subject. Minor detail. The lighting on the green and her dark skin turned out just right.', '2006-05-15 09:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
