(2417059, 333361, 20530, '<td valign="top">AWWW, How precious! Great limited DOF, composition and perspective. Perfect exposure and nice colors, although the blue seems a little grayish on my monitor. Clearly, a personal portrait that will be cherished by your family.</td>', 'AWWW, How precious! Great limited DOF, composition and perspective. Perfect exposure and nice colors, although the blue seems a little grayish on my monitor. Clearly, a personal portrait that will be cherished by your family.', '2006-05-15 11:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
