(2417084, 333757, 57712, '<td valign="top">Interesting title considering the cinder blocks in the background, although maybe that''s an environmental observation. Hehe I think too much! I like it, his expression is thoughtful and the three colors (gray, red, yellow) all blend well together.</td>', 'Interesting title considering the cinder blocks in the background, although maybe that''s an environmental observation. Hehe I think too much! I like it, his expression is thoughtful and the three colors (gray, red, yellow) all blend well together.', '2006-05-15 11:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
