(2417091, 334571, 20530, '<td valign="top">LOL, I had this idea for my self portrait. Guess I won''t be doing that;)<br/>Like the different angles. Nice framing and interesting portrait.</td>', 'LOL, I had this idea for my self portrait. Guess I won''t be doing that;)Like the different angles. Nice framing and interesting portrait.', '2006-05-15 11:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2417092, 334192, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely light in the eyes - cheetah eyes are so beautiful and you''ve really focused on them wonderfully. If this is shot in RAW I wonder how it would look if you warmed the white balance temperature before converting? Might enhance the lighting even further? Nice uncluttered background, though not sure it really conveys much about the environment...</td>', 'Lovely light in the eyes - cheetah eyes are so beautiful and you''ve really focused on them wonderfully. If this is shot in RAW I wonder how it would look if you warmed the white balance temperature before converting? Might enhance the lighting even further? Nice uncluttered background, though not sure it really conveys much about the environment...', '2006-05-15 11:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
