(2417170, 334037, 43410, '<td valign="top">i looked at the previews for a second before i voted on them all, and this is the winner right here.  no doubt.  it just jumped out at me.  i love the overall slight green haze to the image...it''s great.  everything about this is unbelievable.  if this does not win, i will be deeply surprised.  the central placement, and eyes on the top thirds line.  wow :)  technically this is amazing, and just is a great image.  i''ll quit rambling now.  a premature congratulations on your ribbon :)  good luck.  10.</td>', 'i looked at the previews for a second before i voted on them all, and this is the winner right here.  no doubt.  it just jumped out at me.  i love the overall slight green haze to the image...it''s great.  everything about this is unbelievable.  if this does not win, i will be deeply surprised.  the central placement, and eyes on the top thirds line.  wow :)  technically this is amazing, and just is a great image.  i''ll quit rambling now.  a premature congratulations on your ribbon :)  good luck.  10.', '2006-05-15 11:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
