(2417198, 334492, 70, '<td valign="top">Cute pic of mom. :) The photo quality seems rather low - if you''re not using a camera with rather limited megapixels, you may want to work a little on your resizing methods. Also, glasses can be difficult but sometimes if you have the subject tilt them just a bit, you can avoid the glare.</td>', 'Cute pic of mom. :) The photo quality seems rather low - if you''re not using a camera with rather limited megapixels, you may want to work a little on your resizing methods. Also, glasses can be difficult but sometimes if you have the subject tilt them just a bit, you can avoid the glare.', '2006-05-15 12:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2417199, 333007, 51538, '<td valign="top">A pile of earth would help me suspend disbelief.</td>', 'A pile of earth would help me suspend disbelief.', '2006-05-15 12:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
