(2417258, 332223, 15711, '<td valign="top">I had to think of this one before commenting. I do like it.  Very surreal sense to it. 8</td>', 'I had to think of this one before commenting. I do like it.  Very surreal sense to it. 8', '2006-05-15 12:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
