(2417269, 334007, 30018, '<td valign="top">I love that RED hair!  Cool shot of you in your "digital darkroom"  Nice!</td>', 'I love that RED hair!  Cool shot of you in your "digital darkroom"  Nice!', '2006-05-15 12:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
