(2418138, 333035, 42984, '<td valign="top">Fascinating subject and environment but you''ve lost the best of it.  The area to the left of his back is lost to the eye.  Becasue he strats almost centred and is looking right, the composition is compromised.  If you had panned right to put him on thrids left line we would have him facing into the frame and his work which we would be ablke to see more of</td>', 'Fascinating subject and environment but you''ve lost the best of it.  The area to the left of his back is lost to the eye.  Becasue he strats almost centred and is looking right, the composition is compromised.  If you had panned right to put him on thrids left line we would have him facing into the frame and his work which we would be ablke to see more of', '2006-05-15 16:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2418139, 334295, 12733, '<td valign="top">The title should not need the parenthetical information. If she were looking at the needle, rather than straight up at the camera, the injection would be obvious enough to avoid having to say what she''s doing. It would also look a lot more natural.</td>', 'The title should not need the parenthetical information. If she were looking at the needle, rather than straight up at the camera, the injection would be obvious enough to avoid having to say what she''s doing. It would also look a lot more natural.', '2006-05-15 16:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2418143, 334540, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot; I think a vertical format showing more of the stove would have made it really great.</td>', 'Very nice shot; I think a vertical format showing more of the stove would have made it really great.', '2006-05-15 17:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2418144, 334008, 42984, '<td valign="top">This has powerful beginnings but the shallow DOF bugs me.  I tried to see it as  a feature of the shot by isolating him but I kept coming back to what he is doing ands wanted then to see it as well</td>', 'This has powerful beginnings but the shallow DOF bugs me.  I tried to see it as  a feature of the shot by isolating him but I kept coming back to what he is doing ands wanted then to see it as well', '2006-05-15 17:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2418148, 333617, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of environment, nice portrait. I think it would look more natural if he were facing more toward the computer; you could have caught him in partial profile.</td>', 'Nice use of environment, nice portrait. I think it would look more natural if he were facing more toward the computer; you could have caught him in partial profile.', '2006-05-15 17:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2418149, 332250, 42984, '<td valign="top">Now this is very very cool.   the concept of her still and  calm in the middle of mayhem is the perfect environmental portrait!  I am bothered by some of the motion work.  It looks spontaneous but then some it doesn''t so I suspect it was done PP.  That doesn''t detract from the image but it does just a tad on the vote.  If it''s all in-camera then I''m happy to add another point to my 7</td>', 'Now this is very very cool.   the concept of her still and  calm in the middle of mayhem is the perfect environmental portrait!  I am bothered by some of the motion work.  It looks spontaneous but then some it doesn''t so I suspect it was done PP.  That doesn''t detract from the image but it does just a tad on the vote.  If it''s all in-camera then I''m happy to add another point to my 7', '2006-05-15 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2418151, 332539, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice balance between environment and portrait.</td>', 'Nice balance between environment and portrait.', '2006-05-15 17:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
