(2418168, 334230, 42984, '<td valign="top">Stunning location but the portrait really doesn''t work. I am trying to see what''s out of frame all around this image. The subject;s feet, the source of the water at the top and the rest of the cabin to the left.</td>', 'Stunning location but the portrait really doesn''t work. I am trying to see what''s out of frame all around this image. The subject;s feet, the source of the water at the top and the rest of the cabin to the left.', '2006-05-15 17:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
