(2418176, 333360, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is good lighting and portrait. It''s not going to set the world on fire abut it has  technical proficiency that is quite excellent.  Unfortunately DPC voters won''t recognise this</td>', 'This is good lighting and portrait. It''s not going to set the world on fire abut it has  technical proficiency that is quite excellent.  Unfortunately DPC voters won''t recognise this', '2006-05-15 17:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
