(2418184, 333040, 42984, '<td valign="top">I want this to be a high-scoring shot but there''s something that''s holding it back and I don''t know what it is - been studying it for ages too</td>', 'I want this to be a high-scoring shot but there''s something that''s holding it back and I don''t know what it is - been studying it for ages too', '2006-05-15 17:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
