(2418186, 334538, 12733, '<td valign="top">The angle makes this a very striking photo. Good choice of black and white and the ironic title.</td>', 'The angle makes this a very striking photo. Good choice of black and white and the ironic title.', '2006-05-15 17:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2418188, 333915, 42984, '<td valign="top">I love the title and the environment which are complimented by good composition and DOF.  I''m bothered by what appears to be slight loss of sharpness around his mouth and am wondering if this was sharpened after reduction</td>', 'I love the title and the environment which are complimented by good composition and DOF.  I''m bothered by what appears to be slight loss of sharpness around his mouth and am wondering if this was sharpened after reduction', '2006-05-15 17:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
