(2418191, 333360, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done - sharp, well lit and the desk tells you where she is and what she''s doing. The background window helps set the scene as well.</td>', 'Very nicely done - sharp, well lit and the desk tells you where she is and what she''s doing. The background window helps set the scene as well.', '2006-05-15 17:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
