(2418212, 333633, 12733, '<td valign="top">You can stretch the definition of the challenge only so far. Unless I''m seriously missing something, this is all environment and no portrait.</td>', 'You can stretch the definition of the challenge only so far. Unless I''m seriously missing something, this is all environment and no portrait.', '2006-05-15 17:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
