(2418218, 333037, 42984, '<td valign="top">Now this is just whaat the challenge ordered.  The environment is interesting and you have ensured that we can see that by lighting and including it in focus.  the lighting here is brilliant. I know it looks casual and it might be but it is even across the whole portrait including the subject with just a stop difference.  I don''t know if this is going to score well but it should for it extreme technical competence.  I was going to be bugged by the centreed composition but the overall effect of he image over-rode that. This deserves to be a full page illustration in a magazine article</td>', 'Now this is just whaat the challenge ordered.  The environment is interesting and you have ensured that we can see that by lighting and including it in focus.  the lighting here is brilliant. I know it looks casual and it might be but it is even across the whole portrait including the subject with just a stop difference.  I don''t know if this is going to score well but it should for it extreme technical competence.  I was going to be bugged by the centreed composition but the overall effect of he image over-rode that. This deserves to be a full page illustration in a magazine article', '2006-05-15 17:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2418219, 334579, 20530, '<td valign="top">Let me guess, it was a Shar-Pei before you ironed it? Interesting and humorous; but I must go before I get too dizzy.</td>', 'Let me guess, it was a Shar-Pei before you ironed it? Interesting and humorous; but I must go before I get too dizzy.', '2006-05-15 17:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2418220, 334579, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the wierd collection of stuff. Seems kind of overdone, though.</td>', 'I like the angle and the wierd collection of stuff. Seems kind of overdone, though.', '2006-05-15 17:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2418221, 334475, 42984, '<td valign="top">Strong image, powerful.  Great clarity in your subject and then having the Bar sign behind establishes the environment perfectly. Could illustrate a feature magazine article with ease</td>', 'Strong image, powerful.  Great clarity in your subject and then having the Bar sign behind establishes the environment perfectly. Could illustrate a feature magazine article with ease', '2006-05-15 17:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
