(2419445, 334475, 75713, '<td valign="top">this is a nice portrait - and I am sure that you know about the subject''s past - however, I don''t so I am having some difficulty understanding why his environment is a bar and not a ring or a gym unless you were referring to bar fighting.  Still, this is a well done photo and I like the models face.</td>', 'this is a nice portrait - and I am sure that you know about the subject''s past - however, I don''t so I am having some difficulty understanding why his environment is a bar and not a ring or a gym unless you were referring to bar fighting.  Still, this is a well done photo and I like the models face.', '2006-05-16 01:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419470, 333890, 75713, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo, I love the shapes/colors and the broken window in the foreground is a nice touch...  I am having some difficulty seeing how this shot meets the challenge - but I do like (very much) the abstract quality.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo, I love the shapes/colors and the broken window in the foreground is a nice touch...  I am having some difficulty seeing how this shot meets the challenge - but I do like (very much) the abstract quality.', '2006-05-16 01:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419485, 333770, 75713, '<td valign="top">The composition of this shot is good... I can see why you found it a good opportunity for this challenge... I admire your courage in shooting one of the most difficult (IMHO) photos to expose correctly - you exposed for the darker interior and that made the lighter parts blow out - I like the textures in the ground and the wall. The right side should be cropped tighter.</td>', 'The composition of this shot is good... I can see why you found it a good opportunity for this challenge... I admire your courage in shooting one of the most difficult (IMHO) photos to expose correctly - you exposed for the darker interior and that made the lighter parts blow out - I like the textures in the ground and the wall. The right side should be cropped tighter.', '2006-05-16 02:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2419497, 333915, 75713, '<td valign="top">I like the bizarre quality of this shot.. it''s very well photographed and the model''s expression is one that suits the title....on the other hand I am having difficulty seeing how it meets the challenge (an abstract portrayal of writer''s block maybe?) ... but I only subtract one point for that... :)</td>', 'I like the bizarre quality of this shot.. it''s very well photographed and the model''s expression is one that suits the title....on the other hand I am having difficulty seeing how it meets the challenge (an abstract portrayal of writer''s block maybe?) ... but I only subtract one point for that... :)', '2006-05-16 02:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
