(2420186, 333007, 20530, '<td valign="top">MMMmmm Baby! He can dig my grave anytime...wait a minute, let me rethink that!<br/> <br/>This is a beautiful image, though not especially convincing. Wish my hair looked that good after half a day of hard work!;)Minor details aside; it''s very well done. Aside from a couple of hotspots, the colors and lighting are incredible. Composition and mood are excellent. You''ve done a great job of capturing the contemplative and solitary mood that one might expect in such a profession. Very nice!</td>', 'MMMmmm Baby! He can dig my grave anytime...wait a minute, let me rethink that! This is a beautiful image, though not especially convincing. Wish my hair looked that good after half a day of hard work!;)Minor details aside; it''s very well done. Aside from a couple of hotspots, the colors and lighting are incredible. Composition and mood are excellent. You''ve done a great job of capturing the contemplative and solitary mood that one might expect in such a profession. Very nice!', '2006-05-16 09:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
