(2420331, 333904, 31403, '<td valign="top">crop right in to the mirror - you have nice angled lines, but the chrome strip on the right does nothing for you, and the white wall isn''t helping with your story.  I think the backward print on the shirt and the shower curtain (well, with the shaving of course) is all you need for environment and the story behind it.  4</td>', 'crop right in to the mirror - you have nice angled lines, but the chrome strip on the right does nothing for you, and the white wall isn''t helping with your story.  I think the backward print on the shirt and the shower curtain (well, with the shaving of course) is all you need for environment and the story behind it.  4', '2006-05-16 11:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420347, 334553, 92, '<td valign="top">This would be a 10 if the dog didn''t have the hotspots/blown out white on it''s back and tail. The location is beautiful. Nice photo !</td>', 'This would be a 10 if the dog didn''t have the hotspots/blown out white on it''s back and tail. The location is beautiful. Nice photo !', '2006-05-16 11:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
