(2420450, 333677, 92, '<td valign="top">The composition and grass/flower b/g is wonderful ! The only issue I see is the little fellow isn''t in focus enough to see his cute face.</td>', 'The composition and grass/flower b/g is wonderful ! The only issue I see is the little fellow isn''t in focus enough to see his cute face.', '2006-05-16 11:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
