(2420485, 334399, 92, '<td valign="top">oh my ! This is superb !!! I love the wonderful b/g area. All one color so it doesn''t distract from the subject. PERFECT 10 !</td>', 'oh my ! This is superb !!! I love the wonderful b/g area. All one color so it doesn''t distract from the subject. PERFECT 10 !', '2006-05-16 11:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420487, 333647, 92, '<td valign="top">This belongs on a CD or magazine cover ! I love that he has his cig hanging from his lips. It adds that bad boy band feel to it. VERY nice 10 !</td>', 'This belongs on a CD or magazine cover ! I love that he has his cig hanging from his lips. It adds that bad boy band feel to it. VERY nice 10 !', '2006-05-16 11:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420489, 332250, 53990, '<td valign="top">Interesting...like the motion and stillness at the same time.</td>', 'Interesting...like the motion and stillness at the same time.', '2006-05-16 11:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420496, 334482, 92, '<td valign="top">The "hot spots" take from this photo. Try to remember the rule of thirds ect and see if it helps you. If you need some good links just drop me a note. I''ll be happy to help you :)</td>', 'The "hot spots" take from this photo. Try to remember the rule of thirds ect and see if it helps you. If you need some good links just drop me a note. I''ll be happy to help you :)', '2006-05-16 11:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420501, 333037, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites. I love the muted colours, his pose and all of his tools around him.</td>', 'One of my favourites. I love the muted colours, his pose and all of his tools around him.', '2006-05-16 11:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420502, 332250, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites. I love the blurred children, indicating chaos all around the teacher (I was a teacher so I can really relate to this).</td>', 'One of my favourites. I love the blurred children, indicating chaos all around the teacher (I was a teacher so I can really relate to this).', '2006-05-16 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420503, 334589, 92, '<td valign="top">AWESOME photo ! I love how the moving bike against the road gives the viewer a feeling of being on the bike, too. NICE !</td>', 'AWESOME photo ! I love how the moving bike against the road gives the viewer a feeling of being on the bike, too. NICE !', '2006-05-16 11:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420504, 333367, 43774, '<td valign="top">Susi this is beautiful!</td>', 'Susi this is beautiful!', '2006-05-16 11:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420515, 334491, 92, '<td valign="top">I like that this is outside the box. The composition, clarity and lighting are great. My only little issue is the right side. I think it might work better if it were more in focus to bring the eye in. Nice photo !</td>', 'I like that this is outside the box. The composition, clarity and lighting are great. My only little issue is the right side. I think it might work better if it were more in focus to bring the eye in. Nice photo !', '2006-05-16 11:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420518, 333594, 27373, '<td valign="top">Too tightly cropped at the top, need more headroom.</td>', 'Too tightly cropped at the top, need more headroom.', '2006-05-16 11:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420520, 333373, 92, '<td valign="top">GREAT photo. The background area is awesome ! I would like to see her face a little more in focus. This is a nice photo.</td>', 'GREAT photo. The background area is awesome ! I would like to see her face a little more in focus. This is a nice photo.', '2006-05-16 11:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420523, 332133, 92, '<td valign="top">GREAT eye ! This is unique and that makes make it great.</td>', 'GREAT eye ! This is unique and that makes make it great.', '2006-05-16 12:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420531, 332223, 92, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. The use of headphones and him in thirds with that expression are GREAT. I love the sun and it''s reflection. 9</td>', 'I love this photo. The use of headphones and him in thirds with that expression are GREAT. I love the sun and it''s reflection. 9', '2006-05-16 12:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420534, 334538, 27373, '<td valign="top">Has a very ''staged'' feel.  Needs more dishes in the sink and maybe a couple of dirty pots on the stove to really pull the sarcasm out of the title.</td>', 'Has a very ''staged'' feel.  Needs more dishes in the sink and maybe a couple of dirty pots on the stove to really pull the sarcasm out of the title.', '2006-05-16 12:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420535, 334581, 92, '<td valign="top">Very retro looking. I love the use of green for this one. It''s rare that works but it sure does here !</td>', 'Very retro looking. I love the use of green for this one. It''s rare that works but it sure does here !', '2006-05-16 12:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420544, 333903, 37730, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colour and nice focus.</td>', 'Beautiful colour and nice focus.', '2006-05-16 12:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420548, 333705, 37730, '<td valign="top">This brings back so many memories of our local fair.  Great choice.</td>', 'This brings back so many memories of our local fair.  Great choice.', '2006-05-16 12:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420551, 334308, 37730, '<td valign="top">Ah, what a face and expression.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Ah, what a face and expression.  Nicely done.', '2006-05-16 12:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420552, 334209, 48059, '<td valign="top">water--water everywhere and not enough to take a bath....</td>', 'water--water everywhere and not enough to take a bath....', '2006-05-16 12:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420553, 333419, 27373, '<td valign="top">Other than the title I would''ve never guessed this was a grad student, perhaps the guy in the cubicle next to you that keeps sending out the bulk emails, but not a grad student.</td>', 'Other than the title I would''ve never guessed this was a grad student, perhaps the guy in the cubicle next to you that keeps sending out the bulk emails, but not a grad student.', '2006-05-16 12:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420554, 334566, 37730, '<td valign="top">So true and definitely deserving of our recognition.  Well done.</td>', 'So true and definitely deserving of our recognition.  Well done.', '2006-05-16 12:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420561, 333821, 27373, '<td valign="top">It has an overall ''overprocessed'' look to it, the skin tones on the face don''t appear natural.  Perhaps too heavy on the NI.</td>', 'It has an overall ''overprocessed'' look to it, the skin tones on the face don''t appear natural.  Perhaps too heavy on the NI.', '2006-05-16 12:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420567, 334540, 27373, '<td valign="top">Cropped a little too tight.  I find myself being drawn to the hand rather than to the face, if the hand were further back rather than ''coming at'' the camera it would be less distracting.</td>', 'Cropped a little too tight.  I find myself being drawn to the hand rather than to the face, if the hand were further back rather than ''coming at'' the camera it would be less distracting.', '2006-05-16 12:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420593, 334199, 43410, '<td valign="top">great shot.  good eye flow throughout, nice job.  7</td>', 'great shot.  good eye flow throughout, nice job.  7', '2006-05-16 12:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420594, 332764, 43410, '<td valign="top">nice capture, i think this works well as a black and white.  not really sure about the framing, but still a great photo.  great job. 7</td>', 'nice capture, i think this works well as a black and white.  not really sure about the framing, but still a great photo.  great job. 7', '2006-05-16 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420596, 334546, 43410, '<td valign="top">beautiful girl, and beautiful capture.  nice colors.  i think you did a great job.  7</td>', 'beautiful girl, and beautiful capture.  nice colors.  i think you did a great job.  7', '2006-05-16 12:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420598, 332223, 43410, '<td valign="top">wow, this is great.  nice colors, good sunburst up there...very intriguing image.  8</td>', 'wow, this is great.  nice colors, good sunburst up there...very intriguing image.  8', '2006-05-16 12:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420599, 334445, 43410, '<td valign="top">nice job.  i like the DOF you used here. 7</td>', 'nice job.  i like the DOF you used here. 7', '2006-05-16 12:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420600, 333367, 43410, '<td valign="top">nice job ''painting'' this, i like the effect  8</td>', 'nice job ''painting'' this, i like the effect  8', '2006-05-16 12:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420602, 334241, 43410, '<td valign="top">great job, wow what a wide angle.  i like it.  8</td>', 'great job, wow what a wide angle.  i like it.  8', '2006-05-16 12:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420605, 333647, 43410, '<td valign="top">nice dramatic effect here.  9</td>', 'nice dramatic effect here.  9', '2006-05-16 12:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420606, 332737, 43565, '<td valign="top">I find the branches distracting, especially the one that looks like it is in her mouth.</td>', 'I find the branches distracting, especially the one that looks like it is in her mouth.', '2006-05-16 12:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420608, 333872, 43410, '<td valign="top">very nice, i like the square crop.  very good lighting, and sharp focus.  9</td>', 'very nice, i like the square crop.  very good lighting, and sharp focus.  9', '2006-05-16 12:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420610, 334475, 43565, '<td valign="top">He does not seem to be in a boxing environment.  Lighting is probably as good as it could be, but it gives his skin a strange color.</td>', 'He does not seem to be in a boxing environment.  Lighting is probably as good as it could be, but it gives his skin a strange color.', '2006-05-16 12:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420613, 334579, 43410, '<td valign="top">very harsh lighting.  no offense, but keep shooting.  the flash really tunneled you in there, and just distorted the image.  4</td>', 'very harsh lighting.  no offense, but keep shooting.  the flash really tunneled you in there, and just distorted the image.  4', '2006-05-16 12:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420665, 334562, 43410, '<td valign="top">very nice, i love this image.  great detail.  only thing i would have changed is a little more lighting on his right side of his face.  but it is a great image.  8  good luck!</td>', 'very nice, i love this image.  great detail.  only thing i would have changed is a little more lighting on his right side of his face.  but it is a great image.  8  good luck!', '2006-05-16 12:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420677, 333770, 40718, '<td valign="top">I really wish the rest of the wedding party wasn''t blown out, it would have been a great shot. 6 as it is.</td>', 'I really wish the rest of the wedding party wasn''t blown out, it would have been a great shot. 6 as it is.', '2006-05-16 12:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420684, 333417, 43410, '<td valign="top">good photo, but just screams candid to me.  the lighting is somewhat harsh, and it seems to have a red cast to it.  also, i would stay away from centrally locating your subject, unless it has a powerful statement, which this really doesn''t. nothing against the photo, but it would be better if it was cropped with him on the right third line for instance.  i see great potential in this image though, keep shooting.  great job.  5</td>', 'good photo, but just screams candid to me.  the lighting is somewhat harsh, and it seems to have a red cast to it.  also, i would stay away from centrally locating your subject, unless it has a powerful statement, which this really doesn''t. nothing against the photo, but it would be better if it was cropped with him on the right third line for instance.  i see great potential in this image though, keep shooting.  great job.  5', '2006-05-16 12:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420692, 333863, 40718, '<td valign="top">Are people asking for more environment?  I think this is a great portrait, but I really can''t quite tell what you are doing.  Don''t let the low score reflect on the overall quality.  If there is a technical nitpick, it is the overexposure on your head.  It''s possible that is an artifact of USM too. 5</td>', 'Are people asking for more environment?  I think this is a great portrait, but I really can''t quite tell what you are doing.  Don''t let the low score reflect on the overall quality.  If there is a technical nitpick, it is the overexposure on your head.  It''s possible that is an artifact of USM too. 5', '2006-05-16 12:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420694, 334192, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, no environment.</td>', 'Nice portrait, no environment.', '2006-05-16 12:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420702, 334007, 40718, '<td valign="top">Still a beauty even when the twins are in bed.  I''m not positive about the environment though Judi.  What are you telling me?  It looks like you may have been Best in Show at one point, but it''s otherwise non-descript.  This is such a tough challenge, because there are some good shots which just don''t fit what I was looking for. 5</td>', 'Still a beauty even when the twins are in bed.  I''m not positive about the environment though Judi.  What are you telling me?  It looks like you may have been Best in Show at one point, but it''s otherwise non-descript.  This is such a tough challenge, because there are some good shots which just don''t fit what I was looking for. 5', '2006-05-16 12:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420706, 333586, 40718, '<td valign="top">Oh how I wish his face was sharper and more exposed to us.  It would have been an excellent shot. 5</td>', 'Oh how I wish his face was sharper and more exposed to us.  It would have been an excellent shot. 5', '2006-05-16 12:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420710, 334523, 40718, '<td valign="top">Just a bit soft or with motion blur?  Great setup and environment.  I love Maisy. 7</td>', 'Just a bit soft or with motion blur?  Great setup and environment.  I love Maisy. 7', '2006-05-16 12:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2420717, 333367, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well done with the concept.  Overexposed to my taste. 6</td>', 'Well done with the concept.  Overexposed to my taste. 6', '2006-05-16 12:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
