(2420734, 332250, 40718, '<td valign="top">whew, one of the few here which rates top score.  A jewel in a pile of...9. OK, I''m back.  This is my blue ribbon shot by a Looooooong stretch.  I even like it way better than mine (which isn''t going to ribbon, but cross fingers for a Top 10).  I wonder if this is Cindi, but have no real reason to think it is other than she was really proud of her shot.  The only 10 in the challenge.</td>', 'whew, one of the few here which rates top score.  A jewel in a pile of...9. OK, I''m back.  This is my blue ribbon shot by a Looooooong stretch.  I even like it way better than mine (which isn''t going to ribbon, but cross fingers for a Top 10).  I wonder if this is Cindi, but have no real reason to think it is other than she was really proud of her shot.  The only 10 in the challenge.', '2006-05-16 13:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
