(2428120, 334306, 75713, '<td valign="top">good job getting all those sweet faces in focus.. the composition would be improved if the area where they children are playing was not quite as busy (maybe by cropping out the wee guy in the f/g?) - the mountains with the mist really add to this shot.</td>', 'good job getting all those sweet faces in focus.. the composition would be improved if the area where they children are playing was not quite as busy (maybe by cropping out the wee guy in the f/g?) - the mountains with the mist really add to this shot.', '2006-05-18 00:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2428184, 334060, 59047, '<td valign="top">This one is probably my favorite of the challenge... heck, one of my favorite on the site.  I REALLY like this shot &amp; processing.</td>', 'This one is probably my favorite of the challenge... heck, one of my favorite on the site.  I REALLY like this shot & processing.', '2006-05-18 00:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2428260, 333629, 13688, '<td valign="top">i think every photo should have an element that rewards you for taking the time to actually look at an image.  your''s is the little bird.  i also like how the arch of the bear''s back mimics the waterline and the smile making for a very pleasing compostion.  it''s a bit brighter and a little softer than i would like ,though</td>', 'i think every photo should have an element that rewards you for taking the time to actually look at an image.  your''s is the little bird.  i also like how the arch of the bear''s back mimics the waterline and the smile making for a very pleasing compostion.  it''s a bit brighter and a little softer than i would like ,though', '2006-05-18 01:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2428371, 333819, 13688, '<td valign="top">i think you know how much potential this shot had.  It is unfortunate that the focus turned out a bit softer than you would have liked.  I would unsharp mask this with an outrageous radius...like 25 at 200%.  it would bring less attention to the out of focus writing and more attention to the eyes.  though that processing is an acquired taste and definitely not for this site.</td>', 'i think you know how much potential this shot had.  It is unfortunate that the focus turned out a bit softer than you would have liked.  I would unsharp mask this with an outrageous radius...like 25 at 200%.  it would bring less attention to the out of focus writing and more attention to the eyes.  though that processing is an acquired taste and definitely not for this site.', '2006-05-18 01:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
