(2429136, 333367, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really digging the "draganizer" effect you put on this shot or whatever you did in post processing.  Other than that, pretty good and well lit, I would however have preferred it if the DOF was shorter in order to isolate her more frmo the busy bacrkound.  6 from me.</td>', 'Not really digging the "draganizer" effect you put on this shot or whatever you did in post processing.  Other than that, pretty good and well lit, I would however have preferred it if the DOF was shorter in order to isolate her more frmo the busy bacrkound.  6 from me.', '2006-05-18 08:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
