(2430019, 334475, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, like the mood and compositino along with the DOF in this shot but I am not really fond of the lighting, or the lack of it mostly, think some small amount of fill lighting would have helped here, small but still some of it.  Still gave it a 7, something about this shot is connecting with me.</td>', 'Not bad, like the mood and compositino along with the DOF in this shot but I am not really fond of the lighting, or the lack of it mostly, think some small amount of fill lighting would have helped here, small but still some of it.  Still gave it a 7, something about this shot is connecting with me.', '2006-05-18 13:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430060, 333944, 25678, '<td valign="top">This is a very sweet picture, with his feet splashing in the water. However, I don''t knwo about the dark background.  It makes it very dark and mysterious, and I''m not sure that''s the mood that was meant to be conveyed.  This is just an observation...</td>', 'This is a very sweet picture, with his feet splashing in the water. However, I don''t knwo about the dark background.  It makes it very dark and mysterious, and I''m not sure that''s the mood that was meant to be conveyed.  This is just an observation...', '2006-05-18 13:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430063, 334011, 25678, '<td valign="top">Seems just slightly underexposed.  It would be nice to see more ''mechanic'' type stuff in the picture</td>', 'Seems just slightly underexposed.  It would be nice to see more ''mechanic'' type stuff in the picture', '2006-05-18 13:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430069, 334523, 25678, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture.  I''d be careful of how you place you subject.  Maybe moving so her head isn''t in front of the corner of the wall.  THere is also a bit too much NI or Gaussian Blur on her for me.  She''s got a great smile!</td>', 'This is a nice picture.  I''d be careful of how you place you subject.  Maybe moving so her head isn''t in front of the corner of the wall.  THere is also a bit too much NI or Gaussian Blur on her for me.  She''s got a great smile!', '2006-05-18 13:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430072, 332300, 25678, '<td valign="top">Haha, this is a fun portrait</td>', 'Haha, this is a fun portrait', '2006-05-18 13:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430075, 331849, 25678, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you are being hammered by DNMC comments.  I find the flwoer lacking a bit in clarity.  It''s just a touch to soft for me.  Nice use of bokeh</td>', 'I''m sure you are being hammered by DNMC comments.  I find the flwoer lacking a bit in clarity.  It''s just a touch to soft for me.  Nice use of bokeh', '2006-05-18 13:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430078, 334108, 25678, '<td valign="top">Wooo!  Soccer time!  I don''t think you needed to burn the bottom of the picture.  I''m not sure what happened with the background, but it seems a but over saturated</td>', 'Wooo!  Soccer time!  I don''t think you needed to burn the bottom of the picture.  I''m not sure what happened with the background, but it seems a but over saturated', '2006-05-18 13:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430082, 333915, 25678, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take.  I touch to literal for me, but vreative.  It''d be nice if he had some paper in his typewriter</td>', 'Very interesting take.  I touch to literal for me, but vreative.  It''d be nice if he had some paper in his typewriter', '2006-05-18 13:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430087, 333872, 25678, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the expression and use of colours</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the expression and use of colours', '2006-05-18 13:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430092, 333866, 25678, '<td valign="top">This is nit picking, but the glasses seem a touch out of place.  OTher wise this is a ncie picture.  Maybe a slight bump in contrast to bring out the ''old'' feel</td>', 'This is nit picking, but the glasses seem a touch out of place.  OTher wise this is a ncie picture.  Maybe a slight bump in contrast to bring out the ''old'' feel', '2006-05-18 13:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430094, 333890, 25678, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, but I''m sure it''s not fairing well with the DNMC folks.</td>', 'This is a great shot, but I''m sure it''s not fairing well with the DNMC folks.', '2006-05-18 13:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430098, 333891, 25678, '<td valign="top">The idea and composition of this picture are great, but it is lacking on the technical side.  The focus on the models is a bit soft, and I''m not sure if it''s Neat Image or Gaussian blur, but there seems to be a too heavy dose of that applied as well.  It also has a slightly yellowish cast to it that can be fixed with a light touch of post processing</td>', 'The idea and composition of this picture are great, but it is lacking on the technical side.  The focus on the models is a bit soft, and I''m not sure if it''s Neat Image or Gaussian blur, but there seems to be a too heavy dose of that applied as well.  It also has a slightly yellowish cast to it that can be fixed with a light touch of post processing', '2006-05-18 14:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430102, 333878, 25678, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W conversion</td>', 'Nice B&W conversion', '2006-05-18 14:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2430105, 333705, 25678, '<td valign="top">Very nice, colourful shot.  It''s be great if he was looking at the camera...  I like the frogs.  I want one!</td>', 'Very nice, colourful shot.  It''s be great if he was looking at the camera...  I like the frogs.  I want one!', '2006-05-18 14:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
