(2430114, 334358, 25678, '<td valign="top">I think for this particular shot, I would have preferred a deeper DOF so that the hand and syringe were in focus as well.  I hope that needle wasn''t for you!</td>', 'I think for this particular shot, I would have preferred a deeper DOF so that the hand and syringe were in focus as well.  I hope that needle wasn''t for you!', '2006-05-18 14:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
