(2436141, 333872, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very emotive portrait here!  Had to look twice to see what the background was :-)  Lots of neat texture in this shot.</td>', 'Very emotive portrait here!  Had to look twice to see what the background was :-)  Lots of neat texture in this shot.', '2006-05-19 14:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436145, 333679, 35513, '<td valign="top">The composition (with the model in the right side) looks good to me!  It''s generally more effective (for portraits) to have the subject make some kind of eye contact with the camera/viewer.</td>', 'The composition (with the model in the right side) looks good to me!  It''s generally more effective (for portraits) to have the subject make some kind of eye contact with the camera/viewer.', '2006-05-19 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436150, 332737, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the dog!  Is it a German Shorthair?  The cropping is a bit too close for my taste...the dog has such lovely mottled patterns in the fur, but that lends it to blending in with the background.  So a little more background might help define the dog, instead of overpowering it.</td>', 'Good detail on the dog!  Is it a German Shorthair?  The cropping is a bit too close for my taste...the dog has such lovely mottled patterns in the fur, but that lends it to blending in with the background.  So a little more background might help define the dog, instead of overpowering it.', '2006-05-19 14:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436156, 334125, 35513, '<td valign="top">The patterns in the paint give this photo some interest.  For me, portraits are a little more effective when the subject/model is making eye contact with the camera/viewer--though I can see how that would be more difficult to do in this case.</td>', 'The patterns in the paint give this photo some interest.  For me, portraits are a little more effective when the subject/model is making eye contact with the camera/viewer--though I can see how that would be more difficult to do in this case.', '2006-05-19 14:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436162, 334080, 35513, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be in a restaurant brochure!  Definitely tells the story of what this person does--fitting the challenge very well!</td>', 'This looks like it could be in a restaurant brochure!  Definitely tells the story of what this person does--fitting the challenge very well!', '2006-05-19 14:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436172, 333531, 35513, '<td valign="top">For me, this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge topic.  *But* it has a lot of things that I like!  It''s a very emotive photo and I think the black and white works very well.  You''ve done a good job with the composition and the angle of the shot as well.</td>', 'For me, this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge topic.  *But* it has a lot of things that I like!  It''s a very emotive photo and I think the black and white works very well.  You''ve done a good job with the composition and the angle of the shot as well.', '2006-05-19 14:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436178, 334545, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!!  Fits the challenge perfectly!  I really like that he''s in the middle of placing something, giving some action and interest to the photo.  He''s making great eye contact, which really gives the photo some impact to the viewer.  Sepia tones work fine for me here, though I''d be curious to see it in black and white as well!  Great job!!</td>', 'Great portrait!!  Fits the challenge perfectly!  I really like that he''s in the middle of placing something, giving some action and interest to the photo.  He''s making great eye contact, which really gives the photo some impact to the viewer.  Sepia tones work fine for me here, though I''d be curious to see it in black and white as well!  Great job!!', '2006-05-19 14:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436181, 334493, 35513, '<td valign="top">What a great expression on this face!!  Definitely having fun at the playground :-)  Nicely shot.</td>', 'What a great expression on this face!!  Definitely having fun at the playground :-)  Nicely shot.', '2006-05-19 14:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436185, 334236, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like that the colored gels are in this shot...gives a small dash of color to the otherwise black background.  A very nice portrait shot and fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'I really like that the colored gels are in this shot...gives a small dash of color to the otherwise black background.  A very nice portrait shot and fits the challenge very well.', '2006-05-19 14:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436195, 334192, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail and lighting on the cheetah!  For my personal tastes, I feel as though it''s cropped a bit close for *this* challenge...meaning that I wish I had a greater sense of this animal''s environment.  But nicely done nonetheless.</td>', 'Very nice detail and lighting on the cheetah!  For my personal tastes, I feel as though it''s cropped a bit close for *this* challenge...meaning that I wish I had a greater sense of this animal''s environment.  But nicely done nonetheless.', '2006-05-19 14:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436198, 333587, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Nice timing with this capture!  Colors came out really well on this shot.  Certain parts of the bird look a little indistinct to me...perhaps too much NeatImage?  Great job catching that water drop!</td>', 'Wow!  Nice timing with this capture!  Colors came out really well on this shot.  Certain parts of the bird look a little indistinct to me...perhaps too much NeatImage?  Great job catching that water drop!', '2006-05-19 14:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436209, 333705, 35513, '<td valign="top">Plenty to look at for interest in this shot!  Good color all around.  To me, this photo would pop a bit more if the booth worker were looking at the camera.</td>', 'Plenty to look at for interest in this shot!  Good color all around.  To me, this photo would pop a bit more if the booth worker were looking at the camera.', '2006-05-19 14:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436218, 334312, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed!  I like that you captured him right in the action!  Though I''m sure it would be difficult to do, a little bit of eye contact with the camera would really give this a strong portrait feel for me.</td>', 'Very nicely composed!  I like that you captured him right in the action!  Though I''m sure it would be difficult to do, a little bit of eye contact with the camera would really give this a strong portrait feel for me.', '2006-05-19 14:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436231, 333367, 35513, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones of this photo..I''d love to know what you did in post processing!  I really like that you captured the hands being busy, but I''d love it even more if she was looking at the camera..or perhaps even at her feet.  Good lighting on this shot.</td>', 'I really like the tones of this photo..I''d love to know what you did in post processing!  I really like that you captured the hands being busy, but I''d love it even more if she was looking at the camera..or perhaps even at her feet.  Good lighting on this shot.', '2006-05-19 14:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436235, 332450, 35513, '<td valign="top">Amazingly interesting model here!  Love the eye contact and the lighting as well!</td>', 'Amazingly interesting model here!  Love the eye contact and the lighting as well!', '2006-05-19 14:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436237, 334520, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait work here.  They eyes look really good and the composition appeals to me.</td>', 'Very nice portrait work here.  They eyes look really good and the composition appeals to me.', '2006-05-19 14:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436241, 332267, 35513, '<td valign="top">I *love* this shot!  It has great action--the stop motion of the pigeons is great!  In this challenge I''ve usually preferred to have the models eyes somewhat towards the camera....but I just love this shot the way it is!  Definitely tells a story and fits the challenge very well!</td>', 'I *love* this shot!  It has great action--the stop motion of the pigeons is great!  In this challenge I''ve usually preferred to have the models eyes somewhat towards the camera....but I just love this shot the way it is!  Definitely tells a story and fits the challenge very well!', '2006-05-19 14:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436244, 332250, 35513, '<td valign="top">The motion blur on the children in this shot really tells the story!!  I like that the teacher is looking at the camera and that you''ve included plenty of the "environment" in this shot!</td>', 'The motion blur on the children in this shot really tells the story!!  I like that the teacher is looking at the camera and that you''ve included plenty of the "environment" in this shot!', '2006-05-19 14:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436248, 334491, 35513, '<td valign="top">You know...I really like this shot!  The colors and textures are very appealing to me.  It stretches my definition of environmental portrait a bit, but there''s a lot that I like about this photo.</td>', 'You know...I really like this shot!  The colors and textures are very appealing to me.  It stretches my definition of environmental portrait a bit, but there''s a lot that I like about this photo.', '2006-05-19 14:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436257, 334199, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great stop motion on the water at his feet!  Very nice composition and lighting.  It might have more of a portrait feel if the model were making eye contact with the camera a bit more.  I love the backdrop of this environment!</td>', 'Great stop motion on the water at his feet!  Very nice composition and lighting.  It might have more of a portrait feel if the model were making eye contact with the camera a bit more.  I love the backdrop of this environment!', '2006-05-19 14:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436264, 333819, 35513, '<td valign="top">This is a *great* environmental portrait!!!  Love the eye contact, love the composition!!  This photo has a lot of impact...very well done!</td>', 'This is a *great* environmental portrait!!!  Love the eye contact, love the composition!!  This photo has a lot of impact...very well done!', '2006-05-19 14:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436271, 332764, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love the action in this shot!  The lighting and tones of this photo really give this shot a great impact.  Great job!!</td>', 'Wow!  Love the action in this shot!  The lighting and tones of this photo really give this shot a great impact.  Great job!!', '2006-05-19 14:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436276, 333821, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice environmental portrait!  I really like how the uniform pops so brightly against the background.  Good expression on the model!</td>', 'Very nice environmental portrait!  I really like how the uniform pops so brightly against the background.  Good expression on the model!', '2006-05-19 14:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436279, 333647, 35513, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot!!  Love the rugged feel--this photo really gives you a sense of the model.  Lighting is fantastic!</td>', 'Amazing shot!!  Love the rugged feel--this photo really gives you a sense of the model.  Lighting is fantastic!', '2006-05-19 14:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436391, 332250, 36956, '<td valign="top">haha.  Wonderful idea and well executed.  The chaos this image shows gives me giggles.  good wooooork.</td>', 'haha.  Wonderful idea and well executed.  The chaos this image shows gives me giggles.  good wooooork.', '2006-05-19 15:03:58.000000', NULL, 1);
