(2437157, 334307, 55822, '<td valign="top">Doing this in B&amp;W totally makes this shot. He looks like he is having the time of his life. Great job on the exposure, always tough when you have harsh lighting like that.</td>', 'Doing this in B&W totally makes this shot. He looks like he is having the time of his life. Great job on the exposure, always tough when you have harsh lighting like that.', '2006-05-19 17:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
