(2437382, 332681, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think a portrait should show the person, not be a silhouette.  I like the sky, the sun and the object next to the sun.</td>', 'I think a portrait should show the person, not be a silhouette.  I like the sky, the sun and the object next to the sun.', '2006-05-19 18:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
