(2439528, 332223, 58665, '<td valign="top">I am dying to know how you achieved this shot, the water is so black and beautiful.  Can''t wait for the challenge results. You got a perfect 10 from me.  Well done.</td>', 'I am dying to know how you achieved this shot, the water is so black and beautiful.  Can''t wait for the challenge results. You got a perfect 10 from me.  Well done.', '2006-05-20 06:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439568, 334567, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, just what an environmental portrait should be - it shows this clergyman in his element. I really like it a lot. It would be nice if his face was in a bit sharper focus but I think this is worth a 10!</td>', 'This is very nice, just what an environmental portrait should be - it shows this clergyman in his element. I really like it a lot. It would be nice if his face was in a bit sharper focus but I think this is worth a 10!', '2006-05-20 06:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439569, 334540, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really an excellent environmental portrait - it shows this young man in his element being a cook; what is really nice is that the background shows what he does but doesn''t overwhelm the whole picture. The composition is very good, too. I like it a lot and gave you a 10.</td>', 'This is really an excellent environmental portrait - it shows this young man in his element being a cook; what is really nice is that the background shows what he does but doesn''t overwhelm the whole picture. The composition is very good, too. I like it a lot and gave you a 10.', '2006-05-20 06:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439573, 333037, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very excellent environmental portrait, it shows the man very well and also what he does without overwhelming him. I think it might look good with more of the bottom cropped off as well - so you couldn''t see his hand hanging under the table.</td>', 'Very excellent environmental portrait, it shows the man very well and also what he does without overwhelming him. I think it might look good with more of the bottom cropped off as well - so you couldn''t see his hand hanging under the table.', '2006-05-20 07:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439576, 333185, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in this challenge. It is really a well done portrait and shows this man in his element.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in this challenge. It is really a well done portrait and shows this man in his element.', '2006-05-20 07:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439580, 333035, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a nice entry for Environmental Portrait - this suits the challenge perfectly. It is an excellent portrait of this artist doing his thing. I really like the way you''ve used lighting to show his environment yet throw it into the background. One of the best in the challenge - a 10 from me.</td>', 'What a nice entry for Environmental Portrait - this suits the challenge perfectly. It is an excellent portrait of this artist doing his thing. I really like the way you''ve used lighting to show his environment yet throw it into the background. One of the best in the challenge - a 10 from me.', '2006-05-20 07:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439585, 333360, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a very nicely done Environmental Portrait. I think it''s pretty much perfect just the way it is! It would kind of been interesting to use a wider aperture to throw the view in the window into just a bit more of a blur, too.</td>', 'This is a very nicely done Environmental Portrait. I think it''s pretty much perfect just the way it is! It would kind of been interesting to use a wider aperture to throw the view in the window into just a bit more of a blur, too.', '2006-05-20 07:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439588, 334545, 18552, '<td valign="top">Wow, great job - this is such a perfect Environmental Portrait. I think the sepia really works wit this, too - gives it a lovely old-timey feeling.</td>', 'Wow, great job - this is such a perfect Environmental Portrait. I think the sepia really works wit this, too - gives it a lovely old-timey feeling.', '2006-05-20 07:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439590, 334504, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really, really nice. So well done and suits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'This is really, really nice. So well done and suits the challenge perfectly.', '2006-05-20 07:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439594, 333801, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. I love the lights in bokeh behind him - it really makes him look in his environment. Perfect for the challenge!</td>', 'This is really cool. I love the lights in bokeh behind him - it really makes him look in his environment. Perfect for the challenge!', '2006-05-20 07:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439598, 334562, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait. I really would like it if the top of his head wasn''t cut off. It''s the style now to do that but to me it really makes it look incomplete.</td>', 'This is a nice portrait. I really would like it if the top of his head wasn''t cut off. It''s the style now to do that but to me it really makes it look incomplete.', '2006-05-20 07:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439599, 332764, 18552, '<td valign="top">This shows the environment really well but it''s kind of far away from the man to really be a portrait. I do like it though.</td>', 'This shows the environment really well but it''s kind of far away from the man to really be a portrait. I do like it though.', '2006-05-20 07:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439601, 333975, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is nice, I like the "camp" feel to it. The water in the background is nice. Bumpint up to an 8.</td>', 'This is nice, I like the "camp" feel to it. The water in the background is nice. Bumpint up to an 8.', '2006-05-20 07:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439602, 333735, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is very nice - I like the subject in color and the rest in b&amp;w. Bumping up to an 8.</td>', 'This is very nice - I like the subject in color and the rest in b&w. Bumping up to an 8.', '2006-05-20 07:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439604, 333922, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice portrait and suits the challenge well. It would be nice, I think, to see a bit more of his surroundings though to show him more in his element playing his sax.</td>', 'This is a very nice portrait and suits the challenge well. It would be nice, I think, to see a bit more of his surroundings though to show him more in his element playing his sax.', '2006-05-20 07:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439605, 333866, 25355, '<td valign="top">Nice anachronistic shades she has... ;&gt;)</td>', 'Nice anachronistic shades she has... ;>)', '2006-05-20 07:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439606, 333447, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is really, really nice - the only thing that makes it so it isn''t perfect in my eyes is that the very top of his head is cut off. Otherwise, I think it''s just right for this challenge - I really like the way you''ve edited to make the man stand out from the environment yet still show it. I gave you a 9.</td>', 'This is really, really nice - the only thing that makes it so it isn''t perfect in my eyes is that the very top of his head is cut off. Otherwise, I think it''s just right for this challenge - I really like the way you''ve edited to make the man stand out from the environment yet still show it. I gave you a 9.', '2006-05-20 07:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439858, 334590, 40797, '<td valign="top">I love this in black and white. I think that it adds to the environmental feel to the portarait. Great Job!</td>', 'I love this in black and white. I think that it adds to the environmental feel to the portarait. Great Job!', '2006-05-20 10:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439863, 334568, 40797, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!</td>', 'Congratulations!', '2006-05-20 10:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439954, 332250, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the movement of the kids... really helps to portray just how busy the day is for a kindergarten teacher.  Well done! :)</td>', 'Love the movement of the kids... really helps to portray just how busy the day is for a kindergarten teacher.  Well done! :)', '2006-05-20 11:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439964, 334504, 47852, '<td valign="top">Unique perspective and composition.  At first I thought the upper right corner was a bit distracting, but I like the way the lower left balances it out.</td>', 'Unique perspective and composition.  At first I thought the upper right corner was a bit distracting, but I like the way the lower left balances it out.', '2006-05-20 11:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439969, 333755, 43565, '<td valign="top">IMO a portrait controls the setting and the main focus is the subject.  This seems more of a spur of the moment shot.  He is depicted more as an entertainer than an artist.</td>', 'IMO a portrait controls the setting and the main focus is the subject.  This seems more of a spur of the moment shot.  He is depicted more as an entertainer than an artist.', '2006-05-20 11:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439971, 333909, 43565, '<td valign="top">This photo does not say "portrait" to me.  Good focus and DOF.</td>', 'This photo does not say "portrait" to me.  Good focus and DOF.', '2006-05-20 11:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439976, 333757, 47852, '<td valign="top">The foreground seems to match the title you''ve chosen for this shot, but the grey brick background doesn''t.  Interesting expression on this guy.</td>', 'The foreground seems to match the title you''ve chosen for this shot, but the grey brick background doesn''t.  Interesting expression on this guy.', '2006-05-20 11:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439981, 333903, 43565, '<td valign="top">This does not say "portrait" to me.  Good DOF, though I find the leaves in front of the branches distracting.</td>', 'This does not say "portrait" to me.  Good DOF, though I find the leaves in front of the branches distracting.', '2006-05-20 11:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439983, 332764, 43565, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but not really a portrait IMO.</td>', 'Great shot, but not really a portrait IMO.', '2006-05-20 11:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439997, 334579, 43565, '<td valign="top">You have shown us something about your life, but this is not a portrait, IMO.  It is too busy for me.</td>', 'You have shown us something about your life, but this is not a portrait, IMO.  It is too busy for me.', '2006-05-20 11:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440002, 334553, 43565, '<td valign="top">Nice setting, but not a portrait IMO.</td>', 'Nice setting, but not a portrait IMO.', '2006-05-20 11:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440003, 334584, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but it is not a portrait IMO.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but it is not a portrait IMO.', '2006-05-20 11:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440010, 334223, 43565, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I like the lighting and the textures.</td>', 'Good shot.  I like the lighting and the textures.', '2006-05-20 11:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440011, 334488, 43565, '<td valign="top">Good sports shot, but not a portrait IMO.</td>', 'Good sports shot, but not a portrait IMO.', '2006-05-20 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440012, 331538, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is more of a family album type shot, not what I consider a portrait.</td>', 'This is more of a family album type shot, not what I consider a portrait.', '2006-05-20 11:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440014, 334408, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but this is not a portrait, IMO.</td>', 'I like the composition, but this is not a portrait, IMO.', '2006-05-20 11:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440025, 334125, 43565, '<td valign="top">I expect to see the face of the subject of a portrait.  This shot seems more about the wall than the painter to me.</td>', 'I expect to see the face of the subject of a portrait.  This shot seems more about the wall than the painter to me.', '2006-05-20 11:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440033, 334086, 43565, '<td valign="top">I expect to see the face of the subject in a portrait shot.  <br/> <br/>I think a different time of day would have given less harsh lighting.</td>', 'I expect to see the face of the subject in a portrait shot.   I think a different time of day would have given less harsh lighting.', '2006-05-20 11:55:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2440037, 334569, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me, portrait photography controls the setting.  This seems to be a nature shot more than a portrait.  I would like it better with sharper focus.</td>', 'To me, portrait photography controls the setting.  This seems to be a nature shot more than a portrait.  I would like it better with sharper focus.', '2006-05-20 11:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440044, 334490, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is more of a family album type shot than a portrait IMO.  The lamp appears to be growing out of her head.</td>', 'This is more of a family album type shot than a portrait IMO.  The lamp appears to be growing out of her head.', '2006-05-20 12:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440045, 334449, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is more of a nature shot than a portrait IMO.</td>', 'This is more of a nature shot than a portrait IMO.', '2006-05-20 12:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440050, 333594, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think the face of the subject should be included in a portrait shot.</td>', 'I think the face of the subject should be included in a portrait shot.', '2006-05-20 12:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440055, 333259, 43565, '<td valign="top">The face is too dark (maybe a fill flash would have helped?).  I am not sure I would like the flowers in front of the face.</td>', 'The face is too dark (maybe a fill flash would have helped?).  I am not sure I would like the flowers in front of the face.', '2006-05-20 12:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440060, 334499, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would classify this more as a nature shot than a portrait.  The plant is interesting, but there is too much glare on the ladybut.</td>', 'I would classify this more as a nature shot than a portrait.  The plant is interesting, but there is too much glare on the ladybut.', '2006-05-20 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440067, 334112, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me, a portrait is a planned shot with the subject posing.  This seems more of a candid shot.</td>', 'To me, a portrait is a planned shot with the subject posing.  This seems more of a candid shot.', '2006-05-20 12:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440074, 332706, 43565, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t say anything to me about the girl (except that she can jump).  The buildings do not add anything to the shot IMO.</td>', 'This doesn''t say anything to me about the girl (except that she can jump).  The buildings do not add anything to the shot IMO.', '2006-05-20 12:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440084, 332574, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me, this is not a portrait.  I would like to see the face, and the subject seems to be the fire not the person.</td>', 'To me, this is not a portrait.  I would like to see the face, and the subject seems to be the fire not the person.', '2006-05-20 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440094, 334451, 43565, '<td valign="top">The falcon appears to be the subject of the photo, yet the title makes me think the falconer was to be the subject.  I like the focus and lighting of the falcon, but the environment is not included and the hand is a distraction to me.  If the falconer was to be the subject of the portrait then I think his face should have been included.</td>', 'The falcon appears to be the subject of the photo, yet the title makes me think the falconer was to be the subject.  I like the focus and lighting of the falcon, but the environment is not included and the hand is a distraction to me.  If the falconer was to be the subject of the portrait then I think his face should have been included.', '2006-05-20 12:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440104, 334568, 43565, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The background is a bit distracting, a solid part of a building would have been better IMO.  Her skin tone looks too yellow to me.  8</td>', 'Good idea.  The background is a bit distracting, a solid part of a building would have been better IMO.  Her skin tone looks too yellow to me.  8', '2006-05-20 12:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440110, 333037, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think cropping the bottom to about mid-table would have helped.  His left hand and legs don''t add anything IMO.  8</td>', 'I think cropping the bottom to about mid-table would have helped.  His left hand and legs don''t add anything IMO.  8', '2006-05-20 12:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440346, 334308, 34217, '<td valign="top">great expression, but your lighting is not the greatest.  Also I am not sure how I feel about your cropping.  I don''t love it, but I can''t think of a better way that would show the location.</td>', 'great expression, but your lighting is not the greatest.  Also I am not sure how I feel about your cropping.  I don''t love it, but I can''t think of a better way that would show the location.', '2006-05-20 13:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440349, 334112, 34217, '<td valign="top">This is more journalistic than environmental portrait.</td>', 'This is more journalistic than environmental portrait.', '2006-05-20 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440352, 332681, 34217, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but I don''t think is fits the challenge as well as it could.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but I don''t think is fits the challenge as well as it could.', '2006-05-20 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440354, 333663, 34217, '<td valign="top">just wonderful</td>', 'just wonderful', '2006-05-20 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440356, 334491, 34217, '<td valign="top">intersting shot, but it does not fit the challenge at all.</td>', 'intersting shot, but it does not fit the challenge at all.', '2006-05-20 13:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440362, 333372, 34217, '<td valign="top">The challenge is to photograph the subject in an enviroment that says something about them.  I am not sure if the flower field fits you dog.  I don''t know your dog, and it id definatly a beautiful portrait, but it doesn''t say anything about him.  Sorry</td>', 'The challenge is to photograph the subject in an enviroment that says something about them.  I am not sure if the flower field fits you dog.  I don''t know your dog, and it id definatly a beautiful portrait, but it doesn''t say anything about him.  Sorry', '2006-05-20 14:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440366, 333801, 34217, '<td valign="top">Your color looks a little green on my screen.  The photo itself is just wonderful.  Not many people read the challenge very well.  You did a great job.</td>', 'Your color looks a little green on my screen.  The photo itself is just wonderful.  Not many people read the challenge very well.  You did a great job.', '2006-05-20 14:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440373, 333360, 34217, '<td valign="top">Your light is to far to the side.  The shadow from her nose and lips is distracting.  You need to either raise the light up and move it closer you you or move it more to the side to get true side light so her whole side of her face is shadowed.  Also the ratio of light to shadow is a little to high.  You needed to bump up your fill light a little.</td>', 'Your light is to far to the side.  The shadow from her nose and lips is distracting.  You need to either raise the light up and move it closer you you or move it more to the side to get true side light so her whole side of her face is shadowed.  Also the ratio of light to shadow is a little to high.  You needed to bump up your fill light a little.', '2006-05-20 14:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440374, 334213, 34217, '<td valign="top">wonderful</td>', 'wonderful', '2006-05-20 14:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440377, 333595, 34217, '<td valign="top">I think you could have choosen a better angle.</td>', 'I think you could have choosen a better angle.', '2006-05-20 14:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440379, 334506, 34217, '<td valign="top">wonderful 10</td>', 'wonderful 10', '2006-05-20 14:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440383, 333633, 59168, '<td valign="top">Clouds fly with the plane...</td>', 'Clouds fly with the plane...', '2006-05-20 14:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440726, 334502, 47205, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2006-05-20 16:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440791, 334102, 35804, '<td valign="top">The booger alone deserves a 10...thanks for the giggle! : }</td>', 'The booger alone deserves a 10...thanks for the giggle! : }', '2006-05-20 17:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440796, 334567, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is just such a pleasing portrait...I think it''s the smile, so genuine and warm.</td>', 'This is just such a pleasing portrait...I think it''s the smile, so genuine and warm.', '2006-05-20 17:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440906, 333872, 30890, '<td valign="top">Having spent some little time in the shipyards myself I can appreciate this picture, although he does seem a little clean. If I was doing a little detective work I would say that looking at the his overalls he was more a welder than a fitter.</td>', 'Having spent some little time in the shipyards myself I can appreciate this picture, although he does seem a little clean. If I was doing a little detective work I would say that looking at the his overalls he was more a welder than a fitter.', '2006-05-20 17:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440945, 334493, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very journalistic, this a good shot, everything is fitting. The background is not too busy, the lighting is good, the grain fits, this is my kind of shot, respect to you!</td>', 'Very journalistic, this a good shot, everything is fitting. The background is not too busy, the lighting is good, the grain fits, this is my kind of shot, respect to you!', '2006-05-20 18:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441106, 332250, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is THE environmental portrait of the century. 10.</td>', 'This is THE environmental portrait of the century. 10.', '2006-05-20 19:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441109, 332267, 50695, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. 10.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. 10.', '2006-05-20 19:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441113, 334105, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great colors, she''s clearly in her element, wonderful expression. 9.</td>', 'Great colors, she''s clearly in her element, wonderful expression. 9.', '2006-05-20 19:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441118, 334581, 50695, '<td valign="top">This picture is just magic. You have put me in the future! 9.</td>', 'This picture is just magic. You have put me in the future! 9.', '2006-05-20 19:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441124, 333890, 50695, '<td valign="top">great compositio leading to the hand. the subject of the portrait is overcome by his environment. 8.</td>', 'great compositio leading to the hand. the subject of the portrait is overcome by his environment. 8.', '2006-05-20 19:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441130, 334506, 50695, '<td valign="top">Amazing gaze on that boy. beautiful tones. haunting light. 8.</td>', 'Amazing gaze on that boy. beautiful tones. haunting light. 8.', '2006-05-20 19:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441134, 334438, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love this guy''s coy expression and the melodramatic post processing. 8.</td>', 'I love this guy''s coy expression and the melodramatic post processing. 8.', '2006-05-20 19:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441142, 332764, 50695, '<td valign="top">highly dramatic shot with strong geometrical elements = I like it. even though he is not posing, per se, this is exactly how someone like him would probably want to be portrayed. 8.</td>', 'highly dramatic shot with strong geometrical elements = I like it. even though he is not posing, per se, this is exactly how someone like him would probably want to be portrayed. 8.', '2006-05-20 19:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441143, 333447, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love this because it looks like it''s straight out of a Popular Mechanics magazine from the 60s!</td>', 'I love this because it looks like it''s straight out of a Popular Mechanics magazine from the 60s!', '2006-05-20 19:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441149, 334125, 50695, '<td valign="top">I always think it''s a great way to make a portrait of an artist: have him blend right into his work. 8.</td>', 'I always think it''s a great way to make a portrait of an artist: have him blend right into his work. 8.', '2006-05-20 19:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441325, 332450, 41200, '<td valign="top">You isolated your subject nicely. Great shot!</td>', 'You isolated your subject nicely. Great shot!', '2006-05-20 20:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441395, 332250, 41200, '<td valign="top">All of the kids in motion really makes this a great shot! Well done.</td>', 'All of the kids in motion really makes this a great shot! Well done.', '2006-05-20 20:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441405, 334562, 41200, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and feel. I really like the spectral highlight you captured in his eye on the dark half of his face.</td>', 'Nice DOF and feel. I really like the spectral highlight you captured in his eye on the dark half of his face.', '2006-05-20 21:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441409, 334313, 41200, '<td valign="top">I like the movement in his hand while the rest is nice and sharp. Nice portrait.</td>', 'I like the movement in his hand while the rest is nice and sharp. Nice portrait.', '2006-05-20 21:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441667, 332223, 38738, '<td valign="top">Great light , giving you a Blue .</td>', 'Great light , giving you a Blue .', '2006-05-20 23:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441762, 334037, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot and very well executed.  The lighting on her face is fantastic. My only nitpick is that it would have been nice to have the whole circle complete and not cut off at the bottom.</td>', 'Very cool shot and very well executed.  The lighting on her face is fantastic. My only nitpick is that it would have been nice to have the whole circle complete and not cut off at the bottom.', '2006-05-20 23:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441774, 334535, 15204, '<td valign="top">The field makes a very nice background, especially with such nice DOF.  There is a strong green cast on her skin and hair.</td>', 'The field makes a very nice background, especially with such nice DOF.  There is a strong green cast on her skin and hair.', '2006-05-20 23:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441790, 334185, 15204, '<td valign="top">I like his relaxed pose.  His eyes are very dark in this portrait.  Turning him slightly to try to get some light into his deep set eyes and some catchlights would have helped alot.</td>', 'I like his relaxed pose.  His eyes are very dark in this portrait.  Turning him slightly to try to get some light into his deep set eyes and some catchlights would have helped alot.', '2006-05-20 23:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441806, 334162, 54731, '<td valign="top">Nice selective editing!</td>', 'Nice selective editing!', '2006-05-21 00:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441807, 334052, 54731, '<td valign="top">Funny title!</td>', 'Funny title!', '2006-05-21 00:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441808, 334312, 54731, '<td valign="top">Too bad you didn''t wait for the people in the back to dissappear, it would have looked much better</td>', 'Too bad you didn''t wait for the people in the back to dissappear, it would have looked much better', '2006-05-21 00:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442082, 334312, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the photojournalistic feel that this photo has . comp is right on and the subject seems right at home.</td>', 'I like the photojournalistic feel that this photo has . comp is right on and the subject seems right at home.', '2006-05-21 01:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442094, 333872, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and tones. I really like how the DOF captures the subject and the nose of the boat. subject has that hardened look which works very well.</td>', 'Great perspective and tones. I really like how the DOF captures the subject and the nose of the boat. subject has that hardened look which works very well.', '2006-05-21 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442100, 334477, 33672, '<td valign="top">The thing that makes this photo interesting is the same thisg that detracts from it; the camouflage. The subject just blends in too much. Great capture though.</td>', 'The thing that makes this photo interesting is the same thisg that detracts from it; the camouflage. The subject just blends in too much. Great capture though.', '2006-05-21 02:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442105, 334213, 33672, '<td valign="top">I love AZ! You''ve captured the tones of the desert in springtime very well. Shadows don''t detract but the DOF could be a bit deeper to capture more of the beatiful surroundings.... Just my opinion.</td>', 'I love AZ! You''ve captured the tones of the desert in springtime very well. Shadows don''t detract but the DOF could be a bit deeper to capture more of the beatiful surroundings.... Just my opinion.', '2006-05-21 02:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442106, 333502, 33672, '<td valign="top">Interesting comp texture and contrast. Brings the whole image together.</td>', 'Interesting comp texture and contrast. Brings the whole image together.', '2006-05-21 02:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442112, 334590, 33672, '<td valign="top">This looks great in B&amp;W the comp and the shadows work well, although the horse''s nose seem a little too dark.</td>', 'This looks great in B&W the comp and the shadows work well, although the horse''s nose seem a little too dark.', '2006-05-21 02:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442115, 334506, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great post processing as the child seems to be playing in a storm.  nice comp, and tones.</td>', 'Great post processing as the child seems to be playing in a storm.  nice comp, and tones.', '2006-05-21 02:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442117, 333367, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the comp and the capture. It could use a bit more contrast IMO.</td>', 'I like the comp and the capture. It could use a bit more contrast IMO.', '2006-05-21 02:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442189, 334399, 47482, '<td valign="top">love the lighting and dof, very good idea</td>', 'love the lighting and dof, very good idea', '2006-05-21 03:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442191, 334105, 47482, '<td valign="top">looks like it could be in national geographic, they have a photo compertition, you should enter this!</td>', 'looks like it could be in national geographic, they have a photo compertition, you should enter this!', '2006-05-21 03:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442207, 334105, 75713, '<td valign="top">I came back to this shot 3 times now, time to bump my score...</td>', 'I came back to this shot 3 times now, time to bump my score...', '2006-05-21 03:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442245, 332250, 36043, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Well executed.</td>', 'Great idea.  Well executed.', '2006-05-21 04:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442257, 332250, 23430, '<td valign="top">What a great idea and so perfectly executed. Your teacher is great (at staying still) and her expression. The centered subject works well. Just the right amount of movement from the kids. Colours and lighting great, Good balance of portrait and environment.</td>', 'What a great idea and so perfectly executed. Your teacher is great (at staying still) and her expression. The centered subject works well. Just the right amount of movement from the kids. Colours and lighting great, Good balance of portrait and environment.', '2006-05-21 05:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442267, 333185, 23430, '<td valign="top">Expression, lighting, colour and the leading line of the desk are all good. Good DOF putting the BG a bit OOF. Title is great.</td>', 'Expression, lighting, colour and the leading line of the desk are all good. Good DOF putting the BG a bit OOF. Title is great.', '2006-05-21 05:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442268, 333979, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice smile. Nice tones. The grain''s not real bad but it may have been better without it.</td>', 'Nice smile. Nice tones. The grain''s not real bad but it may have been better without it.', '2006-05-21 05:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442274, 332706, 23430, '<td valign="top">This is a fun shot to look at. I don''t like to take too much away but if you had her over to the left with the background remaining as is I think the shot would have better balance and her left arm wouldn''t have been clashing with the building. Her whole gesture is great, especially the left foot. Keep up the good work DPC needs more shots like this.</td>', 'This is a fun shot to look at. I don''t like to take too much away but if you had her over to the left with the background remaining as is I think the shot would have better balance and her left arm wouldn''t have been clashing with the building. Her whole gesture is great, especially the left foot. Keep up the good work DPC needs more shots like this.', '2006-05-21 05:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442275, 334162, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective with good DOF. Desat works well too.</td>', 'Very interesting perspective with good DOF. Desat works well too.', '2006-05-21 06:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442277, 334546, 23430, '<td valign="top">This looks great. The fun expression and smile. Lighting is very good. The lovely background and that hat. Proportions and placement of your model is great. All round this is a very pleasing, easy shot to look at.</td>', 'This looks great. The fun expression and smile. Lighting is very good. The lovely background and that hat. Proportions and placement of your model is great. All round this is a very pleasing, easy shot to look at.', '2006-05-21 06:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442282, 334213, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like how you''ve managed to set him against the plain green of the fairway. The rocks in the foreground and the rocky hill on the left look good.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like how you''ve managed to set him against the plain green of the fairway. The rocks in the foreground and the rocky hill on the left look good.', '2006-05-21 06:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442285, 334535, 23430, '<td valign="top">Other than her skin looking a bit pale (colour cast maybe), I like her expression and stance. Your background is a little bright too. Her hair looks fantastic the way it is set and the angle of the light hitting it makes it look very nice. The background is very good as is the overall composition.</td>', 'Other than her skin looking a bit pale (colour cast maybe), I like her expression and stance. Your background is a little bright too. Her hair looks fantastic the way it is set and the angle of the light hitting it makes it look very nice. The background is very good as is the overall composition.', '2006-05-21 06:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442286, 334165, 23430, '<td valign="top">Your title really helps this shot. Pretty good composition and lighting.</td>', 'Your title really helps this shot. Pretty good composition and lighting.', '2006-05-21 06:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442287, 334102, 23430, '<td valign="top">A bit gross but a great capture none the less.</td>', 'A bit gross but a great capture none the less.', '2006-05-21 06:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442290, 334572, 23430, '<td valign="top">Love the pastel colours. Composition and lighting is good. DOF is spot on. The mud is a great added touch.</td>', 'Love the pastel colours. Composition and lighting is good. DOF is spot on. The mud is a great added touch.', '2006-05-21 06:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442294, 333035, 23430, '<td valign="top">Expression and lighting on him is good. I think the background has been left a bit dark due to flash though. May have been better if the BG was brighter but more   out of focus.</td>', 'Expression and lighting on him is good. I think the background has been left a bit dark due to flash though. May have been better if the BG was brighter but more   out of focus.', '2006-05-21 06:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442298, 334125, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Would have liked to see all the neck.</td>', 'Great composition. Would have liked to see all the neck.', '2006-05-21 06:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442300, 332450, 23430, '<td valign="top">Looks like a character. Shadows are slightly harsh/dark on the face but other than that the lighting is quite good. Composition and DOF are good.</td>', 'Looks like a character. Shadows are slightly harsh/dark on the face but other than that the lighting is quite good. Composition and DOF are good.', '2006-05-21 06:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442329, 334584, 6999, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult, I think, with this kind of shot, to make the dcision about quite how much environment to include, and quite how much ''portrait''; I think you''ve struck that balance pretty well here - thanks to your capture of detail.  The added mystery of precisely what activity is going on here adds interest, and the sense of brightness without over-exposure is good.</td>', 'It''s difficult, I think, with this kind of shot, to make the dcision about quite how much environment to include, and quite how much ''portrait''; I think you''ve struck that balance pretty well here - thanks to your capture of detail.  The added mystery of precisely what activity is going on here adds interest, and the sense of brightness without over-exposure is good.', '2006-05-21 07:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442331, 333944, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great detail, fun, light. I really like this as an entry for this challenge, although i''m afraid the lack of face is going to hurt your score from amny voters. It displays an engagement with his environment, an insouciant absorption that is well communicated. Nice shooting, and I hope it does better for you than I fear it might.</td>', 'Great detail, fun, light. I really like this as an entry for this challenge, although i''m afraid the lack of face is going to hurt your score from amny voters. It displays an engagement with his environment, an insouciant absorption that is well communicated. Nice shooting, and I hope it does better for you than I fear it might.', '2006-05-21 07:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442332, 334125, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of light and texture. Compositional elements are excellently controlled - you''ve made the square crop work well, which is not a straightforward thing. I like it. I''d perhaps have taken the contrast a bit further myself - to make more of the difference of those grey tones.</td>', 'Excellent capture of light and texture. Compositional elements are excellently controlled - you''ve made the square crop work well, which is not a straightforward thing. I like it. I''d perhaps have taken the contrast a bit further myself - to make more of the difference of those grey tones.', '2006-05-21 07:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442333, 334550, 6999, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, but your dodging and burning are not exactly subtlely done, and to my eye make the image just look like it has dark blotches across it. I don''t think you''ve taken the highlights far enough really - the tonality seems really quite grey to me. More contrast throughout the two figures would really add a sense of depth to it, and more detail, and there is certainly room for that without blowing the highlights.</td>', 'Pretty good, but your dodging and burning are not exactly subtlely done, and to my eye make the image just look like it has dark blotches across it. I don''t think you''ve taken the highlights far enough really - the tonality seems really quite grey to me. More contrast throughout the two figures would really add a sense of depth to it, and more detail, and there is certainly room for that without blowing the highlights.', '2006-05-21 07:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442334, 334399, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - especially your framing. I get a sense of dissociation between the figure and the background that is a little unsettling - it''s simply the depth of field, of course, but it has the effect of making her surroundings feel simply like a backdrop perhaps, rather than a world she is involved in; her berlin 1930''s make-up set aginst the nicely ordered georgian architecture perhaps adds to that feeling too. A nice piece of work however, and that point is more interesting than troubling.</td>', 'Nicely done - especially your framing. I get a sense of dissociation between the figure and the background that is a little unsettling - it''s simply the depth of field, of course, but it has the effect of making her surroundings feel simply like a backdrop perhaps, rather than a world she is involved in; her berlin 1930''s make-up set aginst the nicely ordered georgian architecture perhaps adds to that feeling too. A nice piece of work however, and that point is more interesting than troubling.', '2006-05-21 07:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442336, 334514, 6999, '<td valign="top">Poor thing, I hope they/you got it back in the water - it doesn''t look so much like an old and dieing animal. My own immediate reaction would have been to get yourself down to his/her level to shoot: from this point fo view, I think this shot becomes more about people''s reaction to a beached animal than about the animal itself. It''s a good photo, the omission of people''s faces adds a strong element, and exposure control is good.</td>', 'Poor thing, I hope they/you got it back in the water - it doesn''t look so much like an old and dieing animal. My own immediate reaction would have been to get yourself down to his/her level to shoot: from this point fo view, I think this shot becomes more about people''s reaction to a beached animal than about the animal itself. It''s a good photo, the omission of people''s faces adds a strong element, and exposure control is good.', '2006-05-21 07:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442338, 332133, 6999, '<td valign="top">Magical moment - you should be selling it to the travel companies. The curve of the wing of the flyer makes a nice parallel with the circle of the setting sun, and you''ve balanced those two elements within frame very well. Likewise, the secondary parallel of the little cloud and the horiizon make a nice counter-balance. Whilst a well-achieved shot, it''s perhaps not so uncommon an image in itself, and perhaps, for this challenge, doesn''t really tell us enough about the subject of this ''portrait''. For me, it''s absolutely fitting, but having seen what''s been written, as well as from one or two of the comments I have recieved, I suspect it won''t be enough of an orthodox portrait.</td>', 'Magical moment - you should be selling it to the travel companies. The curve of the wing of the flyer makes a nice parallel with the circle of the setting sun, and you''ve balanced those two elements within frame very well. Likewise, the secondary parallel of the little cloud and the horiizon make a nice counter-balance. Whilst a well-achieved shot, it''s perhaps not so uncommon an image in itself, and perhaps, for this challenge, doesn''t really tell us enough about the subject of this ''portrait''. For me, it''s absolutely fitting, but having seen what''s been written, as well as from one or two of the comments I have recieved, I suspect it won''t be enough of an orthodox portrait.', '2006-05-21 07:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442343, 334438, 6999, '<td valign="top">He needs to be looking at that nail, rather than the camera, surely, or his next portrait will be in x-ray form. It''s also a bizarre way to hold a hammer in the first place. Like the details, but not the processing.</td>', 'He needs to be looking at that nail, rather than the camera, surely, or his next portrait will be in x-ray form. It''s also a bizarre way to hold a hammer in the first place. Like the details, but not the processing.', '2006-05-21 08:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442345, 333821, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong sense of character here, which is good. There''s a sense, around his face, of some over-processing: the detail there seems rather created than naturally captured - some areas seem slightly blurred together, but that could of course just be compression to get the file size down.</td>', 'Strong sense of character here, which is good. There''s a sense, around his face, of some over-processing: the detail there seems rather created than naturally captured - some areas seem slightly blurred together, but that could of course just be compression to get the file size down.', '2006-05-21 08:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442346, 334303, 6999, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d softened your flash just a little, which would have reduced or negated that shadow across his forehead. Fill-flash is absolutely right here, fo course - allowing you to make use of the natural contrast of that heavy sunlight.</td>', 'I wish you''d softened your flash just a little, which would have reduced or negated that shadow across his forehead. Fill-flash is absolutely right here, fo course - allowing you to make use of the natural contrast of that heavy sunlight.', '2006-05-21 08:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442349, 334545, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ah, proper marvellous this is. Your dealing with light is a little unsure, i''d say - the left side of the face seems just too far exposed, but it''s a minor point. The model-work is so good that it''s a genuine shock of scale you present, and the hand adds an engagement with that world that is essential to the image. I wish that the ''sky'' were slighly less bland - darker, lighter, whatever, but it''s a muddy nothing tone at the moment, and i find the sepia-toning a little much, would have preferred a straight black-and-white - that would have made more of a connection with the documentary photographs of the age his model depicts I think. But those are minor points, really. This is by far the most interesting shot in this challenge, by streets one might say, and ought to win.</td>', 'Ah, proper marvellous this is. Your dealing with light is a little unsure, i''d say - the left side of the face seems just too far exposed, but it''s a minor point. The model-work is so good that it''s a genuine shock of scale you present, and the hand adds an engagement with that world that is essential to the image. I wish that the ''sky'' were slighly less bland - darker, lighter, whatever, but it''s a muddy nothing tone at the moment, and i find the sepia-toning a little much, would have preferred a straight black-and-white - that would have made more of a connection with the documentary photographs of the age his model depicts I think. But those are minor points, really. This is by far the most interesting shot in this challenge, by streets one might say, and ought to win.', '2006-05-21 08:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442393, 333447, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait; the washed-out quality of the equipment is strange though, especially in a challenge that seems to require the interaction with the subject''s environment.</td>', 'Nice portrait; the washed-out quality of the equipment is strange though, especially in a challenge that seems to require the interaction with the subject''s environment.', '2006-05-21 09:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442395, 334538, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s a certain quality of direct-flash domestic photography that is quite intriguing.</td>', 'There''s a certain quality of direct-flash domestic photography that is quite intriguing.', '2006-05-21 09:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442403, 334562, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fine portrait, with good detail and tonality - the conversion is pretty well done, perhaps the very extreme highlights only causing problems. Good light too. Is the rope alone enough to speak of environment? On balance, I think it is.</td>', 'Fine portrait, with good detail and tonality - the conversion is pretty well done, perhaps the very extreme highlights only causing problems. Good light too. Is the rope alone enough to speak of environment? On balance, I think it is.', '2006-05-21 09:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442406, 334013, 6999, '<td valign="top">The balance of the flowers and the bloke is pretty well done here. Nice image, and I''m glad that the floral element hasn''t been allowed to over-dominate.</td>', 'The balance of the flowers and the bloke is pretty well done here. Nice image, and I''m glad that the floral element hasn''t been allowed to over-dominate.', '2006-05-21 09:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442412, 333904, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t you get soap all over your t-shirt? ;-) I like this - there''s a pure ordinariness about it, a refusal to pander to the ideas of DPC''s clean set-up photography; and also a sense - because of that lack of pandering, probably - of the genuinely real. I like the crowdedness of this space too - it feels, with the collections of bottles, the precarious towel stack, like a real person''s bathroom. And for all that, it''s plainly obvious that this must actually be a set-up idea. I like those paradoxes, and the result.</td>', 'Don''t you get soap all over your t-shirt? ;-) I like this - there''s a pure ordinariness about it, a refusal to pander to the ideas of DPC''s clean set-up photography; and also a sense - because of that lack of pandering, probably - of the genuinely real. I like the crowdedness of this space too - it feels, with the collections of bottles, the precarious towel stack, like a real person''s bathroom. And for all that, it''s plainly obvious that this must actually be a set-up idea. I like those paradoxes, and the result.', '2006-05-21 09:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442494, 333903, 30507, '<td valign="top">Great composition &amp; great colours also</td>', 'Great composition & great colours also', '2006-05-21 10:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442586, 333502, 7703, '<td valign="top">Iceland? At least I don''t understand what he does in this enviroment ... but great dark photo. Tilted background is 50% good and 50% bad. It sure makes the photo more like something you want to look closer at.</td>', 'Iceland? At least I don''t understand what he does in this enviroment ... but great dark photo. Tilted background is 50% good and 50% bad. It sure makes the photo more like something you want to look closer at.', '2006-05-21 11:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442587, 332601, 7703, '<td valign="top">Animals in environmental portrait ... something that I donðt like that much.</td>', 'Animals in environmental portrait ... something that I donðt like that much.', '2006-05-21 11:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442589, 333637, 7703, '<td valign="top">This one is good and should place somewhere in the top 20. Nice DOF.</td>', 'This one is good and should place somewhere in the top 20. Nice DOF.', '2006-05-21 11:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442590, 334176, 7703, '<td valign="top">Portrait? Would you shoot a portrait of some persons feets?</td>', 'Portrait? Would you shoot a portrait of some persons feets?', '2006-05-21 11:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442593, 334013, 7703, '<td valign="top">Lot of contrast here ... man with a cigaret against the flowers. Like it alot nice work.</td>', 'Lot of contrast here ... man with a cigaret against the flowers. Like it alot nice work.', '2006-05-21 11:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442595, 332949, 7703, '<td valign="top">Portrait of a statut</td>', 'Portrait of a statut', '2006-05-21 11:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442600, 334165, 7703, '<td valign="top">The naked chef... I like to eat at your place. But like the lightning nioce crop though I would have the wine glas and the bottle on the other table so it was not hiding the pot.</td>', 'The naked chef... I like to eat at your place. But like the lightning nioce crop though I would have the wine glas and the bottle on the other table so it was not hiding the pot.', '2006-05-21 11:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442605, 334338, 7703, '<td valign="top">To much bluring (Neat Image) and I also do not like photos where you take away colors from everything exept the subject. You always should take photo with that in mind that everyone will se straight away what the subject is so you donð have to take the colors away from everything else.</td>', 'To much bluring (Neat Image) and I also do not like photos where you take away colors from everything exept the subject. You always should take photo with that in mind that everyone will se straight away what the subject is so you donð have to take the colors away from everything else.', '2006-05-21 11:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442606, 333473, 7703, '<td valign="top">Bounce the flash from the ceiling because this black shaddow distracts me.</td>', 'Bounce the flash from the ceiling because this black shaddow distracts me.', '2006-05-21 11:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442610, 334037, 7703, '<td valign="top">I know lot of teenagers but I never see them in environmental like this? Also it looks like you have blured the "background" to make it more interesting ... I think it would be more interesting for me just like it came from the camera. Also maybe to much neat image on the face?</td>', 'I know lot of teenagers but I never see them in environmental like this? Also it looks like you have blured the "background" to make it more interesting ... I think it would be more interesting for me just like it came from the camera. Also maybe to much neat image on the face?', '2006-05-21 11:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442612, 334144, 7703, '<td valign="top">Neat image? And way to much og it...</td>', 'Neat image? And way to much og it...', '2006-05-21 11:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442615, 333853, 7703, '<td valign="top">Don''t see the environmental so it does not fit the challenge though it is a great portrait.</td>', 'Don''t see the environmental so it does not fit the challenge though it is a great portrait.', '2006-05-21 11:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442617, 333863, 7703, '<td valign="top">This is more of a portrait then environmental portrait.</td>', 'This is more of a portrait then environmental portrait.', '2006-05-21 11:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442620, 333948, 7703, '<td valign="top">Funny but I think you should take this paper away ... it just says what flower he is growing but just the look oin his face tells the whole story.</td>', 'Funny but I think you should take this paper away ... it just says what flower he is growing but just the look oin his face tells the whole story.', '2006-05-21 11:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442622, 333367, 7703, '<td valign="top">Nice protrait but did you do something strange to her breast?</td>', 'Nice protrait but did you do something strange to her breast?', '2006-05-21 11:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2442623, 334488, 7703, '<td valign="top">greinilegt að sumarið er að koma og núna verður allt fullt af þessum fótboltamyndum frá ykkur reykvíkingum. Góður fókus annars.</td>', 'greinilegt að sumarið er að koma og núna verður allt fullt af þessum fótboltamyndum frá ykkur reykvíkingum. Góður fókus annars.', '2006-05-21 11:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
