(2442696, 334526, 40370, '<td valign="top">With the dark hat, beard, dark sweater and all, his face is a bit lost to me. Other than that this is a beautiful portrait with nice color and softness.</td>', 'With the dark hat, beard, dark sweater and all, his face is a bit lost to me. Other than that this is a beautiful portrait with nice color and softness.', '2006-05-21 12:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
