(2443053, 333473, 40370, '<td valign="top">Darling little tea drinkers, plenty of sugar at this table. I might have tried a different angle, if you took the shot from above them (rather than eye level) you could have taken better advantage of the yellow wall, the idea is to get rid of the dark horizon line where the wall stops.</td>', 'Darling little tea drinkers, plenty of sugar at this table. I might have tried a different angle, if you took the shot from above them (rather than eye level) you could have taken better advantage of the yellow wall, the idea is to get rid of the dark horizon line where the wall stops.', '2006-05-21 14:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443061, 334586, 40370, '<td valign="top">Charming, I like the blue color in the bg and the red pots really add contrasting horizon. Your DOF is perfect with focus on her face, only nit-pick is her face needs a little more light reflected on it to brighten up her features.</td>', 'Charming, I like the blue color in the bg and the red pots really add contrasting horizon. Your DOF is perfect with focus on her face, only nit-pick is her face needs a little more light reflected on it to brighten up her features.', '2006-05-21 14:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443062, 333037, 34217, '<td valign="top">His hand could have been posed better.  It looks like a stump.  The general rule is not to pose hands so the back or front is fully facing the lens.</td>', 'His hand could have been posed better.  It looks like a stump.  The general rule is not to pose hands so the back or front is fully facing the lens.', '2006-05-21 14:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443065, 332250, 34217, '<td valign="top">I think you light could have been better, but your concept is wonderful!</td>', 'I think you light could have been better, but your concept is wonderful!', '2006-05-21 14:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
