(2443109, 334060, 40370, '<td valign="top">This image is my highest rated in the category of "no people". I did not feel strongly about the human vs non for this challenge. This is a beautiful portrait of a dog and his/her incredible environment. Nice processing. 9</td>', 'This image is my highest rated in the category of "no people". I did not feel strongly about the human vs non for this challenge. This is a beautiful portrait of a dog and his/her incredible environment. Nice processing. 9', '2006-05-21 14:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
