(2443124, 334013, 40370, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors provide an impressive contrast to the sweaty/dirty dull plaid shirt of the hardworking employee. I am glad the backdrop is dark and does not distract from the tight environment.</td>', 'Brilliant colors provide an impressive contrast to the sweaty/dirty dull plaid shirt of the hardworking employee. I am glad the backdrop is dark and does not distract from the tight environment.', '2006-05-21 15:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443129, 332764, 40370, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of light sepia tones, you can see the detail in the rock but it does not take away attention from the climber. I''d like to know where this is.</td>', 'Nice choice of light sepia tones, you can see the detail in the rock but it does not take away attention from the climber. I''d like to know where this is.', '2006-05-21 15:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443133, 333863, 40370, '<td valign="top">Like the balance of color, the yellow and blue is radiant but the face retains a natural tone. I like that is eyes are looking right at the camera, making a statement. The background colors are a bit washed out but not too sure that bright color there would enhance the image. good luck 8</td>', 'Like the balance of color, the yellow and blue is radiant but the face retains a natural tone. I like that is eyes are looking right at the camera, making a statement. The background colors are a bit washed out but not too sure that bright color there would enhance the image. good luck 8', '2006-05-21 15:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443139, 334312, 40370, '<td valign="top">I like the concentrated look of the artist. Nice capture in a public environment, too bad you couldn''t clone out the dude behind him.</td>', 'I like the concentrated look of the artist. Nice capture in a public environment, too bad you couldn''t clone out the dude behind him.', '2006-05-21 15:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443150, 332223, 40370, '<td valign="top">Revitalizing ... different. The sum of the parts; the sun, the water, the reflection all complete this pure environment and human form. The darker sky at the top and the dark water at the bottom make a natural border.</td>', 'Revitalizing ... different. The sum of the parts; the sun, the water, the reflection all complete this pure environment and human form. The darker sky at the top and the dark water at the bottom make a natural border.', '2006-05-21 15:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443204, 332601, 57386, '<td valign="top">amazing shot!</td>', 'amazing shot!', '2006-05-21 15:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443306, 334567, 6999, '<td valign="top">He seems slightly our of focus compared with his environment - just slightly: there''s that blurrinness about his face somehow.</td>', 'He seems slightly our of focus compared with his environment - just slightly: there''s that blurrinness about his face somehow.', '2006-05-21 16:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443311, 334358, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great eyes she has; difficult shot really - all that white is terribly difficult to control in exposure. Brings to mind that cold feeling of liquid being forced into one''s veins: kind of exciting and fearful at the same time.</td>', 'Great eyes she has; difficult shot really - all that white is terribly difficult to control in exposure. Brings to mind that cold feeling of liquid being forced into one''s veins: kind of exciting and fearful at the same time.', '2006-05-21 16:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443326, 333801, 6999, '<td valign="top">The dichotomy of the contact of the eyes in this kind of thing: many seem to think that that <i>makes</i> a portrait, for myself I think it dissociates him from his environment. This is kind of classily typical though - perhaps the exact kind of thing the challenge suggester had in mind. I''m no particular fan or otherwise of it, but it''s plainly assured work.</td>', 'The dichotomy of the contact of the eyes in this kind of thing: many seem to think that that makes a portrait, for myself I think it dissociates him from his environment. This is kind of classily typical though - perhaps the exact kind of thing the challenge suggester had in mind. I''m no particular fan or otherwise of it, but it''s plainly assured work.', '2006-05-21 16:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443334, 334192, 6999, '<td valign="top">One''s tempted to ask ''and the cheetah''s environment is ...'', but perhaps I won''t. Beautifully done, as animal portraits go - the light, the light!</td>', 'One''s tempted to ask ''and the cheetah''s environment is ...'', but perhaps I won''t. Beautifully done, as animal portraits go - the light, the light!', '2006-05-21 16:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443391, 334475, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost definitive, in its way. There''s an implication that is slightly at odds with the actual character shown, too, which for me only adds to the impact.</td>', 'Almost definitive, in its way. There''s an implication that is slightly at odds with the actual character shown, too, which for me only adds to the impact.', '2006-05-21 16:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443411, 333647, 1531, '<td valign="top">1, 2, 3 FULLFRAME!!! ;-)</td>', '1, 2, 3 FULLFRAME!!! ;-)', '2006-05-21 16:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443541, 332250, 25355, '<td valign="top">I can relate to this. One of my top pics in a strong field.<br/>I suspect this wasn''t shot with a DSLR.</td>', 'I can relate to this. One of my top pics in a strong field.I suspect this wasn''t shot with a DSLR.', '2006-05-21 18:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443557, 334545, 25355, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a photo my father took of the Rev. Awdrey (Thomas the Tank Engine author). We went to the Harrogate Model Railway Fair in 1970, and there was the Rev. with his own little model railway - and a pipe in his mouth. I have an autographed book ;&gt;)</td>', 'This reminds me of a photo my father took of the Rev. Awdrey (Thomas the Tank Engine author). We went to the Harrogate Model Railway Fair in 1970, and there was the Rev. with his own little model railway - and a pipe in his mouth. I have an autographed book ;>)', '2006-05-21 18:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443565, 333037, 25355, '<td valign="top">What a lot of tools a bookbinder has! Good composition, nice muted colours.</td>', 'What a lot of tools a bookbinder has! Good composition, nice muted colours.', '2006-05-21 18:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443572, 333559, 25355, '<td valign="top">Good high key shot, and thanks for the use of black and white. It works very well.</td>', 'Good high key shot, and thanks for the use of black and white. It works very well.', '2006-05-21 18:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
