(2443595, 334105, 7485, '<td valign="top">Makes me pause as I sit here in my nice house sipping the Assam tea that was picked by someone much like her. Wonderful color. I like the shallow DOF, but I would have cropped a bit off the bottom. I''d also prefer her looking towards the camera. But all said and done, a very good portrait.</td>', 'Makes me pause as I sit here in my nice house sipping the Assam tea that was picked by someone much like her. Wonderful color. I like the shallow DOF, but I would have cropped a bit off the bottom. I''d also prefer her looking towards the camera. But all said and done, a very good portrait.', '2006-05-21 18:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443606, 333663, 24642, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I really like the natural and relaxed feel.</td>', 'Excellent.  I really like the natural and relaxed feel.', '2006-05-21 18:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
