(2443920, 334162, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image and one of the few that fit perfectly in the Challenge IMO. There''s something about the post-processing that doesn''t seem to flow with the subject(s). Perhaps it''s a little too forced and a little too intentional...the harmony between the two is missing.</td>', 'This is a nice image and one of the few that fit perfectly in the Challenge IMO. There''s something about the post-processing that doesn''t seem to flow with the subject(s). Perhaps it''s a little too forced and a little too intentional...the harmony between the two is missing.', '2006-05-21 20:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
