(2446276, 334297, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave out quite a few 7s in this competition, and this is one of them. 7s are for shots that perfectly capture someone in an environment, so that they seem like part of the environment. You did that here. The lighting screams "racetrack at night" and the light has the same quality on the man as it does on the car.</td>', 'I gave out quite a few 7s in this competition, and this is one of them. 7s are for shots that perfectly capture someone in an environment, so that they seem like part of the environment. You did that here. The lighting screams "racetrack at night" and the light has the same quality on the man as it does on the car.', '2006-05-22 11:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
