(2446647, 332300, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, of the CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: Ha, Ha, very funny shot. Congrats on your PB. Very good score.<br/><b>Composition</b>: Like it, with your head on thirds, with your legs making a movement. Not sure about the half "box" of clothes on the right.<br/><b>Subject</b>: Funny, accurate for the challenge.<br/><b>Technical</b>: Colors are very natural (maybe lightly desaturated for my taste), focus is OK and lightning good.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: Just an idea: the box with clothes on the right could be all over you, as if you were covered with the pile. Maybe that would emphasize your shot.<br/><b>Summary</b>: Very well executed image, technically precise.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-22 13:29:07.</i></td>', 'Hello from Álex, of the CTP MkII   First Impression: Ha, Ha, very funny shot. Congrats on your PB. Very good score.Composition: Like it, with your head on thirds, with your legs making a movement. Not sure about the half "box" of clothes on the right.Subject: Funny, accurate for the challenge.Technical: Colors are very natural (maybe lightly desaturated for my taste), focus is OK and lightning good.Improvement: Just an idea: the box with clothes on the right could be all over you, as if you were covered with the pile. Maybe that would emphasize your shot.Summary: Very well executed image, technically precise. Álex', '2006-05-22 14:28:00.000000', '2006-05-22 14:29:07.000000', 0),
(2446661, 333372, 30861, '<td valign="top">Remarkably good finish for a dog &amp; flower shot :-) I think yous cored well because there''s a definite sense of whimsy and personality here. Good job!</td>', 'Remarkably good finish for a dog & flower shot :-) I think yous cored well because there''s a definite sense of whimsy and personality here. Good job!', '2006-05-22 14:33:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2446672, 333878, 21915, '<td valign="top">Great shot well done. Love the light</td>', 'Great shot well done. Love the light', '2006-05-22 14:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2446677, 334524, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, of the CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: Congrats to the winner<br/><b>Composition</b>: Very good composition IMO, with the girl in one of the thids, the accordion down and the free space on the left up. The BG is OK.<br/><b>Subject</b>: Meets perfectly the challenge. Cute girl, but with too much sun to her, so she cannot have her eyes wide open.<br/><b>Technical</b>: The light is too strong (maybe midday?) and that creates some technical problems: the colors are a bit washed and need more contrast for me; the shadows are too large up-down in her face. And the focus is a bit off her face, it''s more on the instrument.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: Make the shot sooner or later in the day (if the girl is available, LOL).<br/><b>Summary</b>: A very good composition a bit scored down for the problems on lighting.<br/> <br/>Álex</td>', 'Hello from Álex, of the CTP MkII   First Impression: Congrats to the winnerComposition: Very good composition IMO, with the girl in one of the thids, the accordion down and the free space on the left up. The BG is OK.Subject: Meets perfectly the challenge. Cute girl, but with too much sun to her, so she cannot have her eyes wide open.Technical: The light is too strong (maybe midday?) and that creates some technical problems: the colors are a bit washed and need more contrast for me; the shadows are too large up-down in her face. And the focus is a bit off her face, it''s more on the instrument.Improvement: Make the shot sooner or later in the day (if the girl is available, LOL).Summary: A very good composition a bit scored down for the problems on lighting. Álex', '2006-05-22 14:40:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2446700, 334236, 24503, '<td valign="top">Very good. Congrats on your PB and top ten. A very good EP.</td>', 'Very good. Congrats on your PB and top ten. A very good EP.', '2006-05-22 14:57:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2446716, 334236, 5728, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aKiwi:</b></div><hr/><i> How on earth did you manage to get that ugly dude to look almost handsome! (Or did you take it through the bottom of a beer glass??)<br/>Great shot!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Blah blah blah :)</td>', 'Originally posted by aKiwi: How on earth did you manage to get that ugly dude to look almost handsome! (Or did you take it through the bottom of a beer glass??)Great shot!!   Blah blah blah :)', '2006-05-22 15:02:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2446763, 332250, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent pic, fantastic idea. Congrats on your top five finish.</td>', 'Excellent pic, fantastic idea. Congrats on your top five finish.', '2006-05-22 15:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2446807, 334037, 37629, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, you did great.</td>', 'Awesome shot, you did great.', '2006-05-22 15:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
