(2446834, 334572, 30861, '<td valign="top">Man, I am definitely becoming a Harvey groupie I guess. This is yet another of your images I gave a very high score to. I expected to see this in the top 10. Very fine, understated work, as I have come to expect from you.<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'Man, I am definitely becoming a Harvey groupie I guess. This is yet another of your images I gave a very high score to. I expected to see this in the top 10. Very fine, understated work, as I have come to expect from you. R.', '2006-05-22 15:36:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2446883, 333819, 23394, '<td valign="top">way underrated.  i prefer these unposed shots, even though they don''t score that well.</td>', 'way underrated.  i prefer these unposed shots, even though they don''t score that well.', '2006-05-22 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2446887, 333735, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice entry, Deannda! I''m not a selective desat fan, but I can see why you chose to use it here. Like Manny said below, the diagonals of the kids'' heads is really cool... the flute contributes to the lines, and there''s no clutter at all in the shot. I love, love, love how much you all work together with your entries. You''re a wonderful mom and you have awesome kids! Congratulations on a very nice entry.</td>', 'Nice entry, Deannda! I''m not a selective desat fan, but I can see why you chose to use it here. Like Manny said below, the diagonals of the kids'' heads is really cool... the flute contributes to the lines, and there''s no clutter at all in the shot. I love, love, love how much you all work together with your entries. You''re a wonderful mom and you have awesome kids! Congratulations on a very nice entry.', '2006-05-22 16:09:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2446890, 332250, 18450, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!! Congrats on your well deserved top 5 position!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!! Congrats on your well deserved top 5 position!', '2006-05-22 16:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
