(2447026, 333663, 22748, '<td valign="top">I just can''t believe the clarity of this photo! Really nice.<br/> <br/>Manny, if you could post what kind of processing you did, that would be really great. Did you do any local contrast enhancement (USM w/ large radius)?</td>', 'I just can''t believe the clarity of this photo! Really nice. Manny, if you could post what kind of processing you did, that would be really great. Did you do any local contrast enhancement (USM w/ large radius)?', '2006-05-22 17:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
