(2447164, 333903, 19936, '<td valign="top">Boy, I guess I missed the mark on this challenge!  I never even considered a human subject!  I''m just a little on the literal side.  LOL!<br/> <br/>I''m pretty happy that out of the non-human subject photos I did pretty good though.  Thanks for all the comments.</td>', 'Boy, I guess I missed the mark on this challenge!  I never even considered a human subject!  I''m just a little on the literal side.  LOL! I''m pretty happy that out of the non-human subject photos I did pretty good though.  Thanks for all the comments.', '2006-05-22 18:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447219, 334338, 40370, '<td valign="top">Six+ again , you''re never going back are you ;)<br/> <br/>I liked this picture during voting, glad to see it was yours.</td>', 'Six+ again , you''re never going back are you ;) I liked this picture during voting, glad to see it was yours.', '2006-05-22 18:34:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447253, 332250, 41746, '<td valign="top">Very clever... great execution. Well deserved 5th place. Congrats!</td>', 'Very clever... great execution. Well deserved 5th place. Congrats!', '2006-05-22 18:44:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447256, 333007, 35994, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this shot, the dark clouds in the background &amp; the spots of sunlight shining thru work really well together!!</td>', 'I really like the colors in this shot, the dark clouds in the background & the spots of sunlight shining thru work really well together!!', '2006-05-22 18:45:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447293, 332267, 41746, '<td valign="top">Great street candid AND a great portrait. Excellent capture. One of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Great street candid AND a great portrait. Excellent capture. One of my favorites in the challenge.', '2006-05-22 18:53:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447436, 334581, 7560, '<td valign="top">THis is great! I love the matrix like feel to the image. I know it''s probably overly PP''d for DPC, but I love the effect! Nice job.</td>', 'THis is great! I love the matrix like feel to the image. I know it''s probably overly PP''d for DPC, but I love the effect! Nice job.', '2006-05-22 19:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447522, 334037, 52713, '<td valign="top">I thought this shot was awesome. I had it picked for a ribbon. Good job, you deserved a higher score.</td>', 'I thought this shot was awesome. I had it picked for a ribbon. Good job, you deserved a higher score.', '2006-05-22 20:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447580, 333819, 30982, '<td valign="top">Way underrated.  This was one of my top picks.  Composition is excellent and definitely meets the challenge.  Very well done!</td>', 'Way underrated.  This was one of my top picks.  Composition is excellent and definitely meets the challenge.  Very well done!', '2006-05-22 20:21:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447602, 333891, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>I gave this a 6 in voting.  I didn''t see your comment in the forum, but I really liked the expressions on both the hairdresser and the customer.  I also really liked that these are real people in real time, and the composition is very good.  Other than the blur issue, you might have positioned yourself just enough to get rid of the light switch.  I do like the poster behind the hairdresser - adds to the "environment".  Hopefully you''ll take a copy to your hairdresser - I''m betting she''ll love it!</td>', 'Trading Post commentI gave this a 6 in voting.  I didn''t see your comment in the forum, but I really liked the expressions on both the hairdresser and the customer.  I also really liked that these are real people in real time, and the composition is very good.  Other than the blur issue, you might have positioned yourself just enough to get rid of the light switch.  I do like the poster behind the hairdresser - adds to the "environment".  Hopefully you''ll take a copy to your hairdresser - I''m betting she''ll love it!', '2006-05-22 20:31:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447603, 333915, 57358, '<td valign="top">hmm.. nice shot, I wasn''t able to vote on this challenge (just got a membership), but I really like your idea, the literal interpretation of the writer''s mind as his environment is awesome, the only thing to me is that it seems like the focus is on the typewriter whereas I would like his face to be sharper, great composition and colors, etc, nice work.  I would have given it an 8 or 9.  (I like how the background is separated from the writer, it gives that sense of dreamingness or thinking, that the background is his mind...)</td>', 'hmm.. nice shot, I wasn''t able to vote on this challenge (just got a membership), but I really like your idea, the literal interpretation of the writer''s mind as his environment is awesome, the only thing to me is that it seems like the focus is on the typewriter whereas I would like his face to be sharper, great composition and colors, etc, nice work.  I would have given it an 8 or 9.  (I like how the background is separated from the writer, it gives that sense of dreamingness or thinking, that the background is his mind...)', '2006-05-22 20:32:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447625, 334230, 41794, '<td valign="top">I really like the muted tones used for this photo. I think it looks much better than if it had been done "bright". I do agree with previous comments though that the crop seems a little awkward.</td>', 'I really like the muted tones used for this photo. I think it looks much better than if it had been done "bright". I do agree with previous comments though that the crop seems a little awkward.', '2006-05-22 20:37:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447642, 331608, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>First, I really like the use of B&amp;W in this picture - nice tonal range and clarity.  I think this met the challenge well but I suspect some wanted the subject more posed and aware he''s being photographed.</td>', 'Trading Post commentFirst, I really like the use of B&W in this picture - nice tonal range and clarity.  I think this met the challenge well but I suspect some wanted the subject more posed and aware he''s being photographed.', '2006-05-22 20:45:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447659, 333705, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and color you captured here but I suspect some would have preferred the subject appear as though he knows he''s being photographed.  I''m sure you probably heard "looks like a candid" a few times.  This shot does indeed, though, put the subject in his "environment" and quite the colorful environment it is!</td>', 'I like the composition and color you captured here but I suspect some would have preferred the subject appear as though he knows he''s being photographed.  I''m sure you probably heard "looks like a candid" a few times.  This shot does indeed, though, put the subject in his "environment" and quite the colorful environment it is!', '2006-05-22 20:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2447666, 333037, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice, Robert.  Good to see a picture on your top row that doesn''t have water or a skiff in it.  :-)  Note that you received only 2 votes 4 or below - that alone is an amazing stat.  Masterfully done from the angle and lighting of the capture to the wickedly complicated post-processing - how do you know when you''re done?</td>', 'Very, very nice, Robert.  Good to see a picture on your top row that doesn''t have water or a skiff in it.  :-)  Note that you received only 2 votes 4 or below - that alone is an amazing stat.  Masterfully done from the angle and lighting of the capture to the wickedly complicated post-processing - how do you know when you''re done?', '2006-05-22 20:53:38.000000', NULL, 0),
