(2450423, 333891, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>I think this meats the challenge very well, composition is good, nice colors, but shutterspeed is way to slow, the image isn''t sharp and you can see movement in the faces.<br/> <br/>it would be nice to see good movement in the hands, but the faces just have to be 100% frozen.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote in this challenge, but due to the movement I would only give this a 3-4. but with higher shutterspeed, 1/60 - 1/125 this would look much better and the score would be 7-8.</td>', '[[trading post]] I think this meats the challenge very well, composition is good, nice colors, but shutterspeed is way to slow, the image isn''t sharp and you can see movement in the faces. it would be nice to see good movement in the hands, but the faces just have to be 100% frozen. I didn''t vote in this challenge, but due to the movement I would only give this a 3-4. but with higher shutterspeed, 1/60 - 1/125 this would look much better and the score would be 7-8.', '2006-05-23 18:05:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2450435, 333705, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>this is a nice image and fits the challenge,<br/>the composition could be improved, the man looks outside the frame wich is bad, if he''d look the other way the image would be much better,<br/>and there is too much space above him, crop the image below the top shelv and you got a good shot.</td>', '[[trading post]] this is a nice image and fits the challenge,the composition could be improved, the man looks outside the frame wich is bad, if he''d look the other way the image would be much better,and there is too much space above him, crop the image below the top shelv and you got a good shot.', '2006-05-23 18:09:10.000000', NULL, 0),
