(2452165, 334572, 37430, '<td valign="top">**Critique Club**<br/> <br/>COngratulations on high score and placement. You submission has everything to make it a great composition. I tried hard to find anything to comment on (for improvement) bu could not find anything. The only thing which I can think of is bit more of contrast. The expressions of subject are very natural. The DOF is just fine and cropping is perfect (there are many photos with lots of background in this challenge which takes away focus from subject).<br/> <br/>There are some more great portraits (of birds :)) in your portfolio. "simply a robin" is "wow"<br/> <br/>Have a great day!</td>', '**Critique Club** COngratulations on high score and placement. You submission has everything to make it a great composition. I tried hard to find anything to comment on (for improvement) bu could not find anything. The only thing which I can think of is bit more of contrast. The expressions of subject are very natural. The DOF is just fine and cropping is perfect (there are many photos with lots of background in this challenge which takes away focus from subject). There are some more great portraits (of birds :)) in your portfolio. "simply a robin" is "wow" Have a great day!', '2006-05-24 06:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2452169, 334526, 37430, '<td valign="top">**Critique Club**<br/> <br/>Congratulations on high score! Its a perfect composition. All it needed was a little different PP to be a great submission. I would agree with most on "blur" thing. I "feel" use of glow filter to get similar processing might have given better results. Well, this is the only area I could see which might be improved as everything else about this photo is just right :)<br/> <br/>You have got some great photos in your portfolio. "I never saw the sea..." is great! <br/> <br/>Have a nice day!<br/>-Tej</td>', '**Critique Club** Congratulations on high score! Its a perfect composition. All it needed was a little different PP to be a great submission. I would agree with most on "blur" thing. I "feel" use of glow filter to get similar processing might have given better results. Well, this is the only area I could see which might be improved as everything else about this photo is just right :) You have got some great photos in your portfolio. "I never saw the sea..." is great!  Have a nice day!-Tej', '2006-05-24 06:59:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2452187, 334007, 37430, '<td valign="top">** Critique Club **<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your good score! Technically the photo is well executed. Good focus, DOF and exposure. There are few (few) areas which can be improved. First- the lighting is little harsh. Second - The background is bit noisy and Thirdly - the image fits losely with the theme (or it is not easily evident). Overall a good composition which could have been even better if these things were taken care of.<br/> <br/>You have got few great photos in your portfolio. "Road Through Dreams II - Judi Liosatos" is my favorite. Keep us the good work!<br/> <br/>Have a nice day!<br/>-Tej</td>', '** Critique Club ** Congratulations on your good score! Technically the photo is well executed. Good focus, DOF and exposure. There are few (few) areas which can be improved. First- the lighting is little harsh. Second - The background is bit noisy and Thirdly - the image fits losely with the theme (or it is not easily evident). Overall a good composition which could have been even better if these things were taken care of. You have got few great photos in your portfolio. "Road Through Dreams II - Judi Liosatos" is my favorite. Keep us the good work! Have a nice day!-Tej', '2006-05-24 07:05:30.000000', NULL, 0),
