(2457538, 332450, 9906, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/>I don''t know what I can possibly add to the many many comments you have already recieved, a 7+ score and top ten finish.  It''s an awesome shot with incredible lighting and focus.  Well done.<br/>TC<br/><br/><i>Message edited by HBunch - Removed CC status....</i></td>', ' I don''t know what I can possibly add to the many many comments you have already recieved, a 7+ score and top ten finish.  It''s an awesome shot with incredible lighting and focus.  Well done.TCMessage edited by HBunch - Removed CC status....', '2006-05-25 18:35:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2457844, 331608, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post - <br/>I liked this shot. I was one of the few I guess that had no problem with the subjects not looking at the camera. The B&amp;W works pretty well although I would like to see a version with some color - even if it was just a light saturation. Good focus and detail. Overall though you have a nice shot.</td>', 'Trading Post - I liked this shot. I was one of the few I guess that had no problem with the subjects not looking at the camera. The B&W works pretty well although I would like to see a version with some color - even if it was just a light saturation. Good focus and detail. Overall though you have a nice shot.', '2006-05-25 20:12:02.000000', NULL, 0),
