(2462104, 333647, 28742, '<td valign="top">First off, congrats on a top 10! I didn''t vote this challenge, but looking through the comments I am surprised nobody called DNMC. I woulda ding''d you for the fact that if he is a singer, I don''t see that background as his <i>environment</i>. I also think the title throws the whole thing off even more. All just my opinion of course. Other than all that, I think it is a great portrait. ...but then you have already established yourself in that regard. :)</td>', 'First off, congrats on a top 10! I didn''t vote this challenge, but looking through the comments I am surprised nobody called DNMC. I woulda ding''d you for the fact that if he is a singer, I don''t see that background as his environment. I also think the title throws the whole thing off even more. All just my opinion of course. Other than all that, I think it is a great portrait. ...but then you have already established yourself in that regard. :)', '2006-05-27 16:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
