(2903320, 334566, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  First, let me say I think it''s great you wanted to, and did, immortalize Ginger this way.<br/> <br/>But I got much more out of the shot after reading your notes.  Sometimes I wish we could have a challenge where the photo is combined with the notes to tell a story.<br/> <br/>Strictly as a photo, I wasn''t quite sure what her uniform meant since it''s not the classic "nurse white."  And, of course, I had no idea of her specialty.<br/> <br/>I wonder if this would''ve done better with a less-busy background and maybe showing her with some of the equipment she uses?</td>', 'Hmmm.  First, let me say I think it''s great you wanted to, and did, immortalize Ginger this way. But I got much more out of the shot after reading your notes.  Sometimes I wish we could have a challenge where the photo is combined with the notes to tell a story. Strictly as a photo, I wasn''t quite sure what her uniform meant since it''s not the classic "nurse white."  And, of course, I had no idea of her specialty. I wonder if this would''ve done better with a less-busy background and maybe showing her with some of the equipment she uses?', '2006-10-06 14:57:11.000000', NULL, 0),
