(4722434, 333372, 67697, '<td valign="top">I never saw the thread about you losing Betsy.  About 2 weeks later, we lost our almost 12 year old Barney.  So I feel your pain.  I wanted to comment on this photo because it''s wonderful!  I love how she''s posing for you in this floral field.  It''s a beautiful photo and keepsake.  :)</td>', 'I never saw the thread about you losing Betsy.  About 2 weeks later, we lost our almost 12 year old Barney.  So I feel your pain.  I wanted to comment on this photo because it''s wonderful!  I love how she''s posing for you in this floral field.  It''s a beautiful photo and keepsake.  :)', '2008-05-25 11:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
