(5216046, 333037, 46314, '<td valign="top">If I''d voted on this challenge, this would have been my choice for blue. I really love this image. I''ve seen it before, but since I stumbled across it again, I thought I should leave a comment. I don''t think a photographer really gets to choose their own photographic style - basically they develop a style over time through experience. But if I <i>could</i> choose my own style - I''d like to shoot images like this.</td>', 'If I''d voted on this challenge, this would have been my choice for blue. I really love this image. I''ve seen it before, but since I stumbled across it again, I thought I should leave a comment. I don''t think a photographer really gets to choose their own photographic style - basically they develop a style over time through experience. But if I could choose my own style - I''d like to shoot images like this.', '2009-01-24 07:11:58.000000', NULL, 0),
